(E'863e6db9-0906-41de-ae73-dd5c4d1fa30d', E'2025-04-28T00:14:08.211970Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'Put the cylinder in the bowl', E'Both policies did the task perfectly. They both picked up the cylinder and then put it in the bowl. Thus, there is a tie between both policies.'),
