(E'49d1bc91-6723-4449-8296-c072b3a932df', E'2025-04-28T16:17:36.540776Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'put all cups into the yellow bowl', E'Only policy B was able to solve the task completely. Policy B is faster and more confident in its actions compared to policy A. Policy A was slower and also looked confused after finishing the first subtask.'),
(E'da901211-e0d2-4bb5-adf4-b6a0196e8b88', E'2025-04-28T16:23:13.068954Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'pick up the yellow duck on the right and put it in the red cup', E'policy A successfully picked up the correct duck and put it in the cup, policy B picked up the wrong duck, put it in the cup and then after some time, picked up the second duck, it started to move but did not look like it was heading towards the cup before the episode ended.'),
(E'054e0a5e-47e5-439c-a462-9c9984d20eec', E'2025-04-28T16:34:04.825074Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'pick up the yellow duck on the left and put it in the red cup', E'Policy A put both ducks in the cup, the command was to only put 1 in, policy b picked up the wrong duck, dropped it, then when attempting to put it in the cup, it missed the cup'),
(E'51b7042b-886f-46b9-9e6d-75336ffd0086', E'2025-04-28T16:34:33.774552Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pick the dustpan and put it on top of the brush', E'Policy A correctly identifies the target it has to reach, while policy B looks confused by the instruction. However, both policy A and policy B fail to solve the task.'),
(E'25db942f-27aa-4e54-9d9f-91fe8aa03285', E'2025-04-28T16:46:32.167830Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'\\pick up the towel and drape it over the back of the black chair', E'policy B was best, it picked up the towel and then seemed to try to move towards something in the distance. policy A did nothing, no movement'),
(E'd0ebeb84-7346-4fd4-9f77-9847794f9ee9', E'2025-04-28T16:52:32.732479Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pick the blue box and put it in the dustpan', E'Policy A didn''t take any action during the rollout, while policy B nearly completed the task. Policy B is faster but failed to execute the final action confidently.'),
(E'cb00af56-1959-4751-a8e0-36905d17ebe7', E'2025-04-28T16:57:26.927442Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'pick up the towel and drape it over the back of the black chair', E'policy A picked up the correct item but did not drape the towel on the chair, it moved in the opposite direction and dropped it. policy B picked up the towel and almost draped it over the chair, it fell off the chair but was very close, the gripper also tilted in a way like it was trying a ''drape'' motion (for policy b)'),
(E'a574e65f-821d-49d1-90f0-90cdb0230749', E'2025-04-28T17:10:02.695847Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'erase the mark on the table', E'Policy A stayed inactive from the beginning of the episode. Policy B tried its best to solve the task but failed to utilize a tool to make things easy.'),
(E'eab31cde-d2b9-469f-8d66-6b039cee14cf', E'2025-04-28T17:13:55.685547Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'pick up the black board wiper and wipe the text off of the whiteboard', E'policy A picked up the board wiper but then dropped it. policy b picked up the wiper and went to wipe the board but accidentally dropped the wiper, it then continued with a wipe motion so it had the right idea.'),
(E'98f2404f-b859-4397-8c82-6af577fd20a8', E'2025-04-28T17:25:07.823213Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'pick up the black board wiper and use it to wipe the text off of the whiteboard', E'Policy a picked up the board wiper and moved up towards the text on the board, it seemed as though it would wipe the board but dropped the wiper before it started. policy b however, only managed to pick up the wiper it then dropped it and kept approaching the wiper, then when close, backing away, it did this several times before grasping it again, it was weird.'),
(E'dbc150d2-e83f-40be-8297-f5775430daf3', E'2025-04-28T17:29:41.476850Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'clean the table', E'Policy A succeeded at the first subtask within short period while policy B struggled to solve the task after multiple attempts.'),
(E'a8a1f50f-5d09-45cf-bc26-1286bd411437', E'2025-04-28T17:50:39.302938Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'pick up the shiny metal lid by its round handle in it''s center then place the lid to the left of the metal pot', E'neither completed the task but policy A did not move at all, in policy b the robot moved towards the lid and then stopped moving.'),
(E'd31f078d-9b8a-45ad-8a87-03e274dcd605', E'2025-04-28T17:52:40.553471Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'put the black pen in the blue cup', E'Although policy A failed to recover after its first attempt, policy A nearly solved the task while policy B failed to understand the instruction clearly. Policy B was confused with objects of similar shapes.'),
(E'47c62582-dcaa-430d-abbd-5991b2e1b38f', E'2025-04-28T18:05:01.746744Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'pick up the purple lid and place it on top of the glass bottle', E'the policies were very similar, both picked up the lid but dropped it before getting to the bottle, policy b moved around a lot afterwards, it wasnt clear what it''s goal was, therefore i think A was slightly better'),
(E'3a93f1c7-bf5f-47c0-821b-8ba001112216', E'2025-04-28T18:10:01.600949Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'upright the tape', E'Policy A seems to stagger along its trajectory while policy B makes a determined, rapid action. Policy B showed an impressive level of precision as well as confidence.'),
(E'd41bb537-c990-4d90-9531-751b2cfdff73', E'2025-04-28T18:16:36.212258Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'pick up the purple lid and place it on top of the glass bottle', E'policy A picked up the lid after a few failed attempts and move to the top of the bottle, it wasn''t central to the bottle and moved down to its side, then it started to push the bottle to the side as it tried to move the lid onto it. policy b did not move at all'),
(E'ba8e4ec3-f7e7-49ee-b7f1-fdb4b0a68598', E'2025-04-28T19:10:53.095647Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pour the cup into the bowl', E'Policy A makes steady progress through repeated attempts, whereas policy B shows no progress whatsoever.'),
(E'97879fdd-cdda-43f5-9a14-a5b8a0d05f0c', E'2025-04-28T19:25:36.433373Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pick the cable and place it on top of the screwdriver', E'Policy A misunderstood the task instruction, attempting the second target before reaching the initial one. In contrast, policy B successfully completed the first subtask but struggled to pinpoint the exact location.'),
(E'962289d6-47ba-43cf-8d9a-6fb8d8893507', E'2025-04-28T20:00:08.236528Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'put the screwdriver out of the box', E'Policy A, despite struggling to complete the task, was able to navigate	toward the target object. In contrast, policy B failed to reach the correct object and was instead confused by other distractors.'),
(E'1cab0f48-2cbb-485f-b2d6-db7bf5d5b3e4', E'2025-04-28T20:07:16.992016Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the bread in the pot then put on the lid.', E'B did not move. A misunderstood the request and put the bread on top of the lid instead of in the pot.'),
(E'dfa2eded-224c-4ed1-88df-056bf673860e', E'2025-04-28T20:13:36.743886Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'place all the tissues into the box', E'Policy initially struggles to identify the correct target object but later successfully manipulates the desired object after multiple attempts. Meanwhile, policy B is slower compared to policy A and it also lacks porecision.'),
(E'7894acc5-a9a6-44f5-aa3f-775d92526595', E'2025-04-28T20:19:20.112531Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the keys on the rack.', E'A quickly identified and grasped the keys, but did not raise them. B likewise identified the keys and grasped them, but then repeatedly released and regrasped before leaving the keys on the table and moving away.'),
(E'f8653232-d815-44b0-bb41-84beb7dcbf93', E'2025-04-28T20:29:03.169377Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Move the rack to the cutting board.', E'A went away from the scene clearly confused. B made efforts to try to grasp the rack, but was unable to find a safe/effective approach due to the irregular shape of the rack.'),
(E'44e08fb4-dcca-400d-8312-cf6dd88ff38d', E'2025-04-28T20:35:04.058495Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'put the green cup in the box and put the purple cup in the silver plate', E'Policy B nearly solved the task but ultimately failed due to its inability to resolve the ambiguity surrounding the object referenced by the word. In contrast, policy A did not execute any action.'),
(E'0847ac20-39b9-4ac5-8086-f3b8e579ab39', E'2025-04-28T20:40:32.349403Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the green rag on the rack.', E'Both policied placed the rag on the rack, but A put it on one of the arms of the rack while B dumped the rag right on top.'),
(E'01ae643f-594c-4725-a257-f8e5b262dc26', E'2025-04-28T20:50:59.414005Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Wash the plate with the sponge.', E'A got a weak grasp on the sponge but dropped it. B was hesitant and did not grasp the sponge. Neither policy made a move to wash the plate.'),
(E'799b7ad2-df1b-48e9-a356-0df90c21d3ac', E'2025-04-28T20:53:21.059533Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'put the blue cup in the box', E'Under extreme light condition, policy B still manages to solve the task while policy A remains stalled from the beginning. However, policy B fails to accurately locate the exact position where the target object should be placed.'),
(E'7eb1ac2d-a631-4187-9480-f15b688e079c', E'2025-04-28T21:03:19.608457Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Pull the trigger on the drill.', E'A did not move. B started moving towards the drill but was clearly confused and did not get close.'),
(E'270b8a16-e0e4-435a-86ef-20047cc2b3f3', E'2025-04-28T21:10:00.012223Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Stanford'), E'put the avocado in the red plate', E'Policy A didn''t even try to move while policy B picked up the wrong item(the chicken wing) and put it in the plate so policy B did better than A to me'),
(E'88601f20-788c-4e89-bec5-e4cb452f53f2', E'2025-04-28T21:12:02.879994Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pick up the cup that is not stacked with others and place it in the box', E'Policy B quickly identified the target object and reached to it without hesitation while policy A was confused by the distractors.'),
(E'ab0c3a1a-b5d5-4f1f-817f-6d1f22ef3a90', E'2025-04-28T21:13:44.320058Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the pink cup on a book.', E'B quickly picked up the cup and put it on a nearby book. A kept on grasping then releasing the cup, and eventually moved it to the top of a book but never let go.'),
(E'7b2d55b3-3af9-4e07-b014-0bdb6a68aa25', E'2025-04-28T21:25:17.937301Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'place one battery on each dish', E'Policy A is able to transfer the first target object to another location, while policy B gets stuck upon contacting the surface. Although policy A is faster than policy B, it fails to handle the grasped object carefully due to its speed.'),
(E'4f05ca12-ded4-43b0-83bd-6a35ed4ba120', E'2025-04-28T21:27:25.091694Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Take off the circular toy.', E'A froze up and did no approach all the way to the toys, clearly not understanding the request. B detected and attempted to remove the circular toy, but was not able to get a solid grasp to lift it.'),
(E'36a025ba-ea8e-42ed-a8e4-90298eec0117', E'2025-04-28T21:38:58.017114Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the square on the plate.', E'A focused on the rectangle instead of the square, and did not successfully pick it up to move it to the plate. B found the square piece and moved it to the plate quickly.'),
(E'21f72341-5010-47b8-b53c-3f2e6e93b901', E'2025-04-28T21:49:28.700303Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the red piece on the plate.', E'A struggled to find a grasp on the specified part, but eventually did. It froze up in the air and never put it on the plate. B identified the piece, was able to pick it up after some failed grasp attempts, and dropped it onto the plate.'),
(E'8a96b2b5-68cc-44af-97fd-dcc35c296a8f', E'2025-04-28T21:54:09.093303Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Stanford'), E'pick up green avocado and put it in red plate', E'Policy A moved towards the avocado and picked it up while Policy B picked up the chicken instead of the avocado so policy A did better to me'),
(E'6171cfe7-ce6e-4948-90c6-f7f529976e51', E'2025-04-28T22:01:49.858877Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Balance the plate between the blocks.', E'A did not move. B picked up the plate but knocked over the blocks and placed the plate on the table, indicating that it is both clumsy and did not understand the request.'),
(E'dad9837d-d036-4a71-8377-e66a415e3fec', E'2025-04-28T22:12:17.613596Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Pull the pegs out.', E'A made an attempt to move its end effector to the first peg but was hesitant to grab it. B seemed to move randomly in the air and did not approach the pegs.'),
(E'762f6c83-7cd5-4ddd-9830-22e1aec6e951', E'2025-04-28T22:14:31.533175Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Stanford'), E'pick up brown puppet and put in brown box ', E'Policy B moved towards puppet while policy A was moving in arbitrary positions thus Policy B did better than A'),
(E'81a85b7c-3fa8-4476-b464-597b9229ea8b', E'2025-04-28T22:21:23.296777Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the food on the plate.', E'A picked up the food and put it on the plate, although the food was somewhat hanging over the edge. B slowly drooped down, but made no decisive or intelligent motion.'),
(E'8625c44d-5fda-44c8-9a2a-ff5b5d796143', E'2025-04-28T22:29:03.106103Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the tool on the plate.', E'Both policies got confused and focused on the food instead of the tool. They both also failed to pick up the food and acted very sporatically. A at least picked up the food, while B did not.'),
(E'2ca640ef-1db4-440d-b457-78b950cffe3d', E'2025-04-28T22:30:32.789310Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Stanford'), E'put red box in brown box ', E'Policy B moved towards the red box although it had no success in picking it up while Policy A didn''t even move towards the red box'),
(E'b22b2588-dfc0-4f0e-8a79-25f42a4b9cde', E'2025-04-28T22:31:20.933460Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University of Washington'), E'Pick up only the toy robot and place it in the brown box', E'A barely even moved and staye still. B also did poorly but it at least moved close to the robot interms of picking it up but it still wasnt able to do anything substantial.'),
(E'996f2c22-6e4b-4616-90db-fb6f80499041', E'2025-04-28T22:44:41.068827Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Stanford'), E'pick up red box and put in brown box ', E'Policy B moved towards the red box and tried to figure out how to pick it up while Policy B went in random positions'),
(E'3cb05d31-18ce-4154-897d-bec852521e5b', E'2025-04-28T22:48:33.806236Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University of Washington'), E'Cover the bowl with the blue plate', E'A just moved around randomly but got close to the bowl and plate. B barely evanything.'),
(E'5f4f174f-1464-41e3-a8b4-9b3e4bacf4eb', E'2025-04-28T23:06:13.113476Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University of Washington'), E'Cover the robot with the bowl', E'Both A and B attempted to grab the bowl and place it on the robot. However, neither A nor B actually managed to grab the bowl, which meant that they couldn''t actually succeed in the task. They both got close to the bowl but couldnt grab it.'),
(E'2d1a9a3e-92e1-40bb-bab6-3d93c7fb5962', E'2025-04-28T23:35:02.986386Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Place the croissant in the pot and then put the lid on the pot', E'Policy A was not able to grab the croissant so at some point it gave up and moved on to grabbing the pot lid but was not able to grasp it either in time. Policy B ignored the croissant entirely and went for the lid first. It confidently grasped the lid and placed it on the pot (although a but crooked).'),
(E'5da5c262-e00b-42c6-a45f-6d7f54c019c2', E'2025-04-28T23:35:47.884123Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University of Washington'), E'A robot is encapsulated between two mugs. Take the robot and place it in the the bowl. ', E'A was the better policy. A was able to knock down one fo the cups and reveal the robot. Although it could not complete the entire task of placing the robot in the bowl, it got halfway through the entire task. Policy B was worse as it just moved around randomly and didnt complete any part of the task.'),
(E'514bf697-7324-40fe-8c8c-6c7b3ee8f870', E'2025-04-28T23:36:04.342171Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'close the top drawer', E'Policy B moved to the notebook during the eval while policy A moved towards the drawer but wasn''t able to precisely move to one of the drawer to close it'),
(E'0b12b78d-cf42-4b86-84da-c51f8d95d4cd', E'2025-04-28T23:50:54.811368Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put marker in the drawer', E'Policy B successfully completed the task by putting marker in the drawer, though the first few seconds it freze after heading to the marker. Policy A just moved to the right hand side where marker was placed and stopped there for the rest of the time'),
(E'c3efabdc-9788-49e2-99ad-97b62f2b9e69', E'2025-04-28T23:55:20.656464Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University of Washington'), E'Pour some juice in the white cup. Then keep the juice bottle back. ', E'For policy A the robot was able to get close to the bottle but did not grab it. However, for policy B it did even worse since it just moved around randomly.'),
(E'df5c5643-14b2-45c6-b736-9bd3ba01501b', E'2025-04-29T00:06:15.292538Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'move the eraser to cloth', E'Policy A is slightly better. Policy A attempted to pick up the eraser and the direction is clearly headed to eraser; policy B on thther hand kept pushing the drawer further without any clear sign of moving to eraser which is on top of the drawer'),
(E'a52371e1-b3a1-4019-b821-461203d672ab', E'2025-04-29T00:21:12.919973Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University of Washington'), E'Place the robot on the purple plate', E'Which policy did you prefer, A, B, or ''tie''? A was slow and methodical and attempted to grab the robot however missed a few times and wasn''t able to do anything after that. B was more rash and faster and ended up knocking down the robot in a place where it was unable to completely complete the task. A at least had a chance of completing the task which is why it recieved a higher score.'),
(E'58437626-0f78-45e4-95e2-b9b913e3c13a', E'2025-04-29T00:22:48.858795Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put the duster on notebook', E'Policy B attempted to move both eraser and duster to notebook but the duster was not quite placed on the notebook (only arrived at the rear and time was running out). Policy A only moved the eraser to notebook and kept adjusting the eraser to the center of notebook.'),
(E'8b5f086f-39b9-4628-aa8f-63446b5085e4', E'2025-04-29T00:42:29.227797Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University of Washington'), E'Pour the ketchup on to the tray.', E'A was much faster than B and made a few weak attempts at moving closer to the ketchup bottle, but overall just moved around randomly. B was much slower and I feel like if it had more time it would have completed more of the task. It got to the perfect position to grab the ketchup bottle but it did not have time to grab it. One downside was that it was slower.'),
(E'32cc76fb-eaca-44b5-8f62-e35a0725e589', E'2025-04-29T01:01:48.860435Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University of Washington'), E'Stack the brown block ontop of the green block. ', E'A was flailing around and and eventually got close to the brown block, however didnt get very close to grabbing it, as it missed when try to grab. B was slower but figured out quickly that the brown block was important and before the epiode ended, it looked like it was about to grab the brown cube. However, it did not grab the cube before the episode ended but it was still more accurate than A.'),
(E'60b019bc-18fc-457a-908f-f736edea0eb8', E'2025-04-29T01:05:06.664826Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'clean up dust on the table', E'Both policy did poorly. It is supposed to use the mop on the right to clean up the dust but in both trials, it piced up the eraser and hovered around the circle of dust'),
(E'e19f1e99-ab12-4cb2-82c5-36c7673e2d68', E'2025-04-29T01:21:28.136521Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put marker on white bowl', E'Both policies were only able to head towards the eraser and grab it on the surface. None of the trials saw the robot could successfully pick up the eraser.'),
(E'0c7adb96-8186-4f17-b775-370fd52f7208', E'2025-04-29T01:26:36.270294Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University of Washington'), E'Place the green cube on the gray tray. Then place the brown cube on top of the green cube.', E'Policy A was more accurate, measured, and slow as it was able to eventually grab a hold of the green cube but didnt continue the task after that. Policy B was faster yet it accidentally hit the green cube down. However, instead of completing the correct task after that, it instead grabbed the brown cube and threw it on the gray tray and it looked like it was about to stack the green cube on top of the brown cube until it ran out of time. However, it never actually grabd the green cube. Policy B showed more understanding of the task even though it got the order wrong.'),
(E'f946baeb-e94b-462d-8ec0-fbeec98e1242', E'2025-04-29T01:39:36.827044Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'stack black bowl on white bowl', E'Policy a initially headed towards the black bowl but then switched up to white bowl and grabbing it to the edge of the table. Policy B was only moving the white bowl  on top of drawer'),
(E'dcced4dd-7a3b-4f4c-894c-c1a9596b852d', E'2025-04-29T01:52:32.016224Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put eraser in drawer', E'Policy B picked up the eraser but left it on the black bowl instead. Policy A attempted to pick up the black bowl and dropped it right after.'),
(E'19b7afac-9475-436a-a98b-7a3c22a1e05a', E'2025-04-29T01:56:59.001453Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Touch the stop sign.', E'Policy A did not move. Policy B touched the incorrect sign.'),
(E'a035597b-a8fd-4d51-a417-2f2c57a02f50', E'2025-04-29T02:07:24.532981Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Put the left duck in the right cup.', E'Policy A was faster at picking up the duck. Also, policy B picked up both ducks when I only asked it to pick up the left duck, making me think that perhaps it didnt understand the task properly.'),
(E'792f1468-f640-4ed1-b83c-2e512550a54b', E'2025-04-29T02:16:49.706164Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Put the right duck in the left cup.', E'Both policies failed the task. They both picked up the wrong duck. Instead of following instructions, they just went for the object closest to the arm at the start of the episode.'),
(E'9717f076-3206-4ab2-999c-ce9f35df09e8', E'2025-04-29T02:35:51.961979Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Pickup the thick, individual test tube from the blue stand.', E'Policy A attempted to pick up the test tube like I asked. It did not succeed but it got pretty close to picking up the correct tube I identified. Policy B didnt move at all.'),
(E'e21e8484-3186-4d3d-92d8-0116c3b48a42', E'2025-04-29T02:51:59.366973Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Move all the red cups to the top of the box.', E'Policy A tried to put the cup on the box. Policy B succeeded with one cup but not with the second cup. Policy B was much more confident in its movement.'),
(E'a6d0f0b2-252d-459a-9853-3bfb6e7adee6', E'2025-04-29T03:02:16.571004Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Move both red cups on top of the box.', E'Both policies tried to complete the task (putting cups on top of a high box), but neither succeeded. Policy A stayed close to the box while trying, but policy B started moving back and forth farther away, making me prefer policy A.'),
(E'8d9b3753-9c1d-48e8-b0cd-0b67119d3f1b', E'2025-04-29T03:13:53.803349Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Move the plastic croissant from the box to the green cloth.', E'Policy B didnt move at all.'),
(E'ccb15e04-ae1e-490c-be0e-2d90cbd1976b', E'2025-04-29T03:24:53.210283Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Move the green cloth to the lower table.', E'Policy A did not move at all.'),
(E'66368840-7ad6-418c-9fb7-70142c4db71c', E'2025-04-29T03:54:22.306936Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the napkin in the drawer and close it.', E'A ignored the napkin and closed the drawer. B got immediately confused and tried to pick up the tablecloth.'),
(E'0c099faf-28ee-4d63-9a5a-82a5822cf932', E'2025-04-29T04:05:59.759589Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Get the bread from the drawer.', E'A got the bread out of the drawer. B seemed to move randomly, and did not approach anything.'),
(E'647465d5-177c-4917-acd8-bc9ada7ff00c', E'2025-04-29T04:17:53.599764Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Cover the plastic piggy bank with the blue cloth.', E'Both A and B targetted the wrong piggy bank (going for the ceramic instead of plastic one). A did a better job of achieving full coverage, while B get there faster. In the end B also took off the cloth, reversing its progress.'),
(E'db315255-4bd5-418d-99c9-79bbf1f3c30a', E'2025-04-29T04:29:05.143251Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Uncover the wooden block.', E'A grabbed the cloth covering the block but then let go. A then got confused and went to the drawer. B immediately went to a spot between the cloth and the drawer, and then stopped moving.'),
(E'0debb320-edfa-400e-b63f-acce7d015a9e', E'2025-04-29T04:41:32.884444Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Lay the block on its side.', E'A froze up after a few seconds, becoming confused. B was confused and kept attempting to grasp the block (which is too large for it) and was unable to knock it over.'),
(E'f3ee5084-5290-4ac0-a007-a4f4fa7b47e4', E'2025-04-29T04:49:32.452642Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Roll over the block.', E'Both A and B were confused and did not motion to move over the block, but A was more sporadic than B and so A wins.'),
(E'bc405b62-52ac-4141-9289-1119e3eac709', E'2025-04-29T04:59:19.830539Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Play the xylophone with the green hammer.', E'Both A and B found the hammer but were unable to grasp it. A wins out because it felt more cohesive and directed in its movements.'),
(E'f11a7e13-a565-4978-8ebb-503fd5427f17', E'2025-04-29T05:15:27.902072Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Hit the cymbal.', E'A did not move. B got confused and grabbed hte napkin, then it hently ran into the cymbal (although it is unclear whether that was intentional or not.'),
(E'c5f102be-b950-4df2-b057-2f50083743f8', E'2025-04-29T05:24:05.336824Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Lay the spoon on the xylophone.', E'A moved forward and froze up. B tried to pick up the drum. Both failed.'),
(E'5273fa6f-bc04-4333-822a-7479ac250d23', E'2025-04-29T05:35:29.062952Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Push down on the sponge.', E'A and B both failed to make any meaningful movement.'),
(E'6f4b9736-58ec-4adf-b2ac-40c2bab03e28', E'2025-04-29T05:51:36.066013Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Stab the bread with the chopstick.', E'A did not move. B was confused but eventually picked up the chopstick. Unfortunately B dropped it rather than stabbing the bread.'),
(E'31fe3faa-3d29-4354-9f6a-3bdb36e6ba2c', E'2025-04-29T06:06:27.285930Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the bread vertically in the cup.', E'A picked up the bread and was unsure what to do with it. B picked up the bread and looked like it was trying to go to the cup, but was distracted by the cloth.'),
(E'02448d6d-4891-4395-82ae-7bf5f74f1225', E'2025-04-29T06:23:26.856615Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Switch the purple and pink cups.', E'A kept picking up and placing down the pink cup. B grabbed the purple cup and knocked over the pink cup, putting the purple cup in its place.'),
(E'69f9098b-86c9-419e-9c4b-75f8ae7f7525', E'2025-04-29T06:38:48.774445Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the pink cup on the plate.', E'A picked the wrong color cup, and struggled to find a good grasp. B did not move.'),
(E'a3c9a361-7c51-454f-bdc8-adaaadfccde3', E'2025-04-29T06:51:23.780710Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the blue toy on the yellow toy.', E'A picked up the correct toy and moved it on top of the target toy, but it did not let go. B did not move.'),
(E'16724580-ce3b-4174-9def-b834309667e3', E'2025-04-29T07:02:28.549040Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Balance the red hammer on the purple toy.', E'A grabbed the wrong hammer and moved towards the wrong color toy. B grabbed the correct hammer, went towards the wrong color toy, and was unable to maintain its grasp.'),
(E'd25151dd-e1c7-4851-ab78-9ccdfdd94e50', E'2025-04-29T07:15:54.292209Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Balance the hammer on the block.', E'A knocked over the block, which it was not supposed to do. B found a good pose to grasp from, but didn''t close the end effector.'),
(E'8c403b66-067e-47ae-aed3-6020672ae547', E'2025-04-29T07:25:08.358140Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the hammer on the block.', E'A got confused and went away from the scene. B struggled initially to get a grasp, picked up the hammer, and dropped it on top of the block (although it fell off due to being improperly balanced).'),
(E'4490e42e-060a-49c9-9f14-1920db0235dc', E'2025-04-29T07:37:31.788270Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Stack the orange legos.', E'A did not move. B dropped one lego onto the other, but from too far away for any precision.'),
(E'3699b5f6-cdc7-41ea-99a3-0d06bd1b1974', E'2025-04-29T07:51:50.833005Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the yellow cup between the orange legos.', E'A failed to make any intelligent motions. B tried but failed to pick up the yellow cup.'),
(E'ab0c0fc7-fc6e-4238-a969-7edb65d9f110', E'2025-04-29T08:12:33.078602Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'put the ball next to the carrot', E'Policy B nearly completed the task but failed to land the object carefully. Policy A struggles to locate the target due to the presence of distractors.'),
(E'b4a84b16-928c-4678-81d0-87e1962dee37', E'2025-04-29T08:13:21.803750Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Pick up the phone.', E'A was confused and couldn''t find out where to go. B moved towards the phone but didn''t find a good grasp.'),
(E'b3907924-e138-4cfd-afce-c9312df3acc3', E'2025-04-29T08:21:28.600750Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Hang up the phone.', E'A grasped the phone but was confused as to how to hang it up. B did not move.'),
(E'dd7d4d2e-7b59-4032-9d0a-b1218fa668ba', E'2025-04-29T08:34:46.053050Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the rubber bands in the cardboard box.', E'A did not move. B was unable to identify the bag of rubber bands and instead went for the cord of the phone.'),
(E'e79a09f0-4c02-4a75-8129-ec57b65ed471', E'2025-04-29T08:44:43.253074Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the marker on the paper.', E'A did not move. B tried to find the marker but was uable to.'),
(E'9c22211a-a447-4689-b5e9-e897d62abfdd', E'2025-04-29T08:45:30.811955Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pull out the tissue and put it in the blue bowl', E'Only policy B was able to complete the task. Its actions appeared fast and decisive, though slightly lacking in precision. Policy B succeeded on the second attempt. Policy A, on the other hand, remained stationary throughout the rollout.'),
(E'0758f7b0-7c02-4724-ae6f-e3a5e7c7f059', E'2025-04-29T08:56:28.796660Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the marker in the cup.', E'A grasped and started rotating downwards, seemingly unable to find the cup. B grasped faster than A did, and started motioning towards the cup when it dropped the marker as well.'),
(E'3e307922-88ea-4398-b005-044ae959bc0b', E'2025-04-29T09:04:14.655897Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pick the carrot and place it in the yellow bowl', E'Policy B''s actions are slightly better than that of policy A because it at least tried to grasp the target object with multiple attempts. Policy A was confused by other distractors. Both failed to solve the task.'),
(E'7ac4ded2-7c0b-42d8-a328-00b50c974f20', E'2025-04-29T09:07:44.547500Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Press a button on the phone.', E'A moved to grasp the phone and hit the button with one of its fingers (maybe intentional, maybe not). B closed its fingers and very deliberately pushing a button.')
INSERT INTO sessions (id, occurred_at, site_id, instruction, notes) VALUES
(E'533a0161-86c9-4411-8365-72e0f282a92e', E'2025-04-29T09:20:16.796843Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Wipe the paper with the dry erase marker.', E'A tried to pick up the dry erase marker but flipped it on its side. A then used the side of the marker to wipe the paper. B picked up and dropped the dry eraser twice, then left it and moved on to try to grab the rubber bands instead of wiping.'),
(E'8890c219-753d-42ea-9f30-3348ac94ae4c', E'2025-04-29T09:22:38.093777Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'unstack the cups and put carrot in one of the cups', E'Both policy A and policy B failed to do the remaining half of the task composition. Policy A, however, understood the order of the subtasks and was able to execute the actions accordingly. Meanwhile, policy B ignored the first half of the task instruction and proceeded to the latter subtask.'),
(E'9b3c53bb-3de4-4ae9-a6bf-86b062ac6d0f', E'2025-04-29T09:31:40.205022Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Flip over the stack of papers.', E'A went to the right side of the papers which was more cluttered and would be harder to grasp. B went to the more optimal left side. Neither policy succeeded in finding a grasp.'),
(E'df7e3cec-fbdf-4ae9-89a3-2c4c93dd7b11', E'2025-04-29T09:42:06.394042Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Close the box.', E'A got into a relatively better position than B to close the box. A then oscillated back and forth, only partially closing the box. B started twisting the lid and disturbed the scene.'),
(E'aa698485-0a8a-4073-986c-5e29c6f2ef53', E'2025-04-29T09:50:00.588894Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Unpack the box.', E'A did not move. B moved to try to unpack the box but closed the lid down further instead, not understanding the way that the lid of this box works.'),
(E'd2f2b54e-f714-4aaf-91f7-acc58bceb11a', E'2025-04-29T09:51:46.006322Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'knock the purple cup into the wooden box', E'Policy B followed the most effective trajectory, allowing it to solve the task with ease. In contrast, policy A appears to lack an understanding of the correct direction.'),
(E'1cc61c9d-106d-4270-8e12-840e8d60e00c', E'2025-04-29T10:02:03.660805Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Throw away the trash.', E'A struggled to pick up the first piece of trash. B had no issue throwing out the first piece of trash, but after picking up the second piece of trash it pushed away the trashcan due to poor pathing.'),
(E'0bef3871-51e4-4f00-9eff-de6fbcd96a29', E'2025-04-29T10:10:29.803417Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'place the cup on the yellow dish', E'Policy B successfully completed the task, while policy A exhibited redundant and repetitive actions for most of the rollout. Policy B required multiple attempts to grasp the target object.'),
(E'c350b0ad-2de2-48b2-bdde-a98569596c61', E'2025-04-29T10:14:41.532620Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Set the table.', E'Neither A nor B got the cup off the plate, but both tried to grasp and remove it. B wins because it got a better grasp and was feasibly on its way to removing the cup.'),
(E'1d35d057-4813-4334-ac34-cd2a372b3bcd', E'2025-04-29T10:24:42.176807Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pour the cup into the tape', E'Both policy A and policy B failed to solve the task. However, policy B demonstrated better performance, as it was able to reach the target object, whereas policy A remained entirely stationary throughout the rollout.'),
(E'31050a60-de63-4f13-b1a6-26ce96d6b174', E'2025-04-29T10:29:51.365915Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Finish setting the table.', E'The point of finish setting the table is to se if the policies can recognize that the only thing left to do is to unstack the plates. A went for one of the cups that was already where it should be. B went for the plates but was not able to get a good grasp.'),
(E'bc04f9ef-f7bd-48bd-aa05-1b13f01d610f', E'2025-04-29T10:47:11.848588Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pick the pliers and place it in the box', E'Policy A succeeded at the task with minimal attempts. Initially, it became stuck after contacting the surface but later managed to recover from this state. Policy B, on the other hand, remained still throughout the episode.'),
(E'864e8ddb-9b63-4bf1-938c-0909bcd3e54c', E'2025-04-29T10:47:25.685861Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the bolt in the drawer.', E'B did not move. A tried to grab the drill instead of the bolt.'),
(E'a6a8431b-7ecb-43cc-81b0-76b2bb647e59', E'2025-04-29T10:55:53.854864Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Move the bag of drill bits near the power drill.', E'A was unable to get a good grasp on the bag of drill bits. B grabbed the bag, hesitated, and moved them only slightly towards the drill.'),
(E'5a89344f-76e3-4bf7-9641-27934b3489f2', E'2025-04-29T13:19:23.542723Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the bolt in the gray box.', E'A failed to grasp the bolt. B grasped the bolt but immediately started moving in the wrong direction thereafter.'),
(E'4f81f625-bd14-4357-a221-30a92a593cb9', E'2025-04-29T15:02:14.832026Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'put all cups into the bin', E'Policy B remains frozen from the beginning of the episode, while policy A manages to complete the first half of the task before freezing as well.'),
(E'48360ef7-487f-456e-91a8-3de64b165d4d', E'2025-04-29T15:20:10.835893Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'place all the trash into the bin', E'Policy A did not take any action and remained in its initial position. In contrast, policy B made multiple attempts and nearly completetd the task, though it lacked some precisions.'),
(E'405c6c08-2136-4e76-9fd1-91cc8808c688', E'2025-04-29T15:41:54.659344Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'place the shoes inside the box', E'Policy A nearly completed the task with confidence, falling short by just a small margin of precision. Policy B, on the other hand, remained frozen during the rollout.'),
(E'e8b8e8d2-a165-462c-8f4c-0e88e2689af4', E'2025-04-29T15:55:48.401344Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Take the rag off the rack.', E'A quickly performed the requested task. B did not move.'),
(E'2bc382b8-1228-4808-a31a-8ef7cccb855f', E'2025-04-29T16:09:40.964234Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Move the grey box to the cutting board.', E'Both policies were confused and went for the cardboard box instead of the grey one. A collided more with the cabinet while B managed to find an intelligent approach to grabbing the wrong box.'),
(E'f03d81b4-71b8-46be-8367-afd9bb3ad950', E'2025-04-29T16:19:23.552233Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Close the small drawer.', E'A made a closing motion but was not aligned with the drawer. B froze up almost immediately.'),
(E'dfa198ed-26bc-4ddf-9582-02978af61c43', E'2025-04-29T16:19:38.996810Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pick the eggplant and place it in the bowl', E'Policy A succeeded at the task on its second attempt, demonstrating fast and confident actions. In contrast, policy B failed to take any action.'),
(E'8f5f85bf-3145-4b1b-8311-ffbc8a4c84dc', E'2025-04-29T16:29:43.657734Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Cover the drill with the green rag.', E'B did not move. A tried to find a grasp on the rag but kept moving through the rack the rag was on almost knocking it over.'),
(E'fff333cb-b6aa-4bb1-815a-be4506907c6b', E'2025-04-29T16:39:42.097788Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Dump out the grey tray.', E'A grasped the grey tray but then let go, not progressing further. B only pushed the grey tray to the side a bit, never grasping it. Both seemed to struggle to understand what the task was asking of them.'),
(E'5a9e8912-f4dc-4d02-bbb6-4969eafc4812', E'2025-04-29T16:46:25.266043Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'close the drawer', E'both policies move toward the drawer but they did not touch the drawer'),
(E'e9fd9264-3f5a-412d-be92-9680a8d4b9a6', E'2025-04-29T16:47:53.059883Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'pick the carrot and place it in the metal bowl', E'Policy B correctly interpreted the texture of the objects and was therefore able to solve the task with confidence. Meanwhile, policy A struggled to determine where to put the grasped object.'),
(E'66c43fa7-1902-4f3a-9a34-83147d14b1a8', E'2025-04-29T16:51:15.915923Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Place the grey tray on the blue cabinet.', E'A did not move. B found a good grasp pose for the grey tray but never closed its gripper, freezing up instead.'),
(E'8d4b1a63-cfbe-4ceb-992a-d7931c6f443b', E'2025-04-29T17:00:28.906490Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put tape into the drawer', E'Policy A put the tape into the drawer for the first try. Policy B move toward the tape but did not pick up the tape'),
(E'8bbcf4b1-75ef-4e4d-a58b-ce8c92dc8fe1', E'2025-04-29T17:01:32.509960Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'erase the board', E'Although policy B showed repetitive motions, such as repeatedly opening and closing the gripper, it made more progress toward completing the task. In contrast, policy A appeared to freeze after its initial attempt.'),
(E'88b77a72-af92-43b1-b0a8-a43ed78b8c17', E'2025-04-29T17:09:49.114741Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Take the lid off the jar and pour it onto the bread.', E'A was more aggressive than B, and when A failed to get a good grasp on the lid it kept pushing the jar until it fell over. B failed to grasp the lid, but it was non destructive.'),
(E'df38ba87-13b4-473c-9d40-5e752725ea61', E'2025-04-29T17:16:06.274553Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put towel in the white bowl', E'both policies mvoe toward the yellow notebook instead of the towel'),
(E'4d9be754-0168-44fd-ab58-c4e09996c6b9', E'2025-04-29T17:21:12.672384Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Stir the pot with the wooden spoon.', E'A was unable to get a grasp because it pushed the wooden spoon to close to the plate. B was hesitant to commit to a grasp but eventually got the spoon up and towards the pot.'),
(E'c4a07785-34a4-4e66-b9f1-7225123075de', E'2025-04-29T17:30:53.975220Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Stir the pot with the plastic spoon.', E'Both policies were going for the wrong material spoon. A picked up the wood spoon and moved towards the pot, while B was not able to grasp any spoon.'),
(E'60b694ec-b903-4b9a-8427-ddd3e43c14e4', E'2025-04-29T17:32:25.398377Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put the tape into the purple bowl', E'both policies completed the task for their first try'),
(E'65fc04ef-d595-44bf-9bc5-f736f2ab43e5', E'2025-04-29T17:41:23.644696Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the pink cup near the plate.', E'A found a grasp of the pink cup but then let go, and started acting unreasonably. B never moved.'),
(E'005387dc-76ab-405e-b363-b2182a075b5c', E'2025-04-29T17:45:07.197244Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put the brown bowl in the purple plate', E'POlicy A put the white bowl into the purple plate instead of the brown bowl while policy B did not do any thing'),
(E'c168f74f-171c-4950-9b91-d4d32ee67981', E'2025-04-29T17:50:13.241156Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Put the blue spoon and the bread on the plate.', E'A did not move. B moved towards the blue spoon but then froze.'),
(E'bf786116-6d66-4fac-bedb-4573a4c9a54d', E'2025-04-29T18:02:44.909608Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Take the lid off the pot.', E'A and B both managed to pull the lid off the pot. A put it in a most adjascent spot, while B tried to put the lid down on top of a cup, disrupting the scene.'),
(E'0fc6fc86-df01-47cf-a13b-7637c151ff8d', E'2025-04-29T18:05:26.257519Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put the strawberry in the pink bowl', E'Policy A move toward the strawberry the the beginning, while policy B move toward the orange at first, then move toward the strawberry. Both policies did not pick up the strawberry'),
(E'78200768-4286-40a7-8580-e5864e341721', E'2025-04-29T18:09:37.648298Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Yonsei'), E'fold the towel', E'Policy A fails to find the optimal grasping position to solve the task. Policy B takes faster actions and also confidently solves the task without any redundant repetitive actions.'),
(E'4ba7c1e8-39f4-4e74-8eb4-c5580711f90e', E'2025-04-29T18:13:27.456954Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'UT Austin'), E'Move the bread to the plate.', E'A tried to take the lid off the pot. B tried to pick up the wooden spoon. Both policies completely missed the instruction.'),
(E'30425a50-58e7-42b3-900e-0be6577549d5', E'2025-04-29T18:21:53.554222Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'University Montreal'), E'Drop the rubber ducks iin the drawer and then close the drawer', E'y'),
