(E'12df73f6-1659-4b1a-8790-a08fca4f1616', E'2025-07-02T21:21:37.562792Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'stack pink bowl onto white bowl', E'Policy B tried to pick up the pink bowl several times but the gripper was too loose to hold into it so the grasp success is very low. Policy A smoothly transported the pink bowl onto the white bowl ithe first trial'),
(E'b37517d3-65a6-4348-b975-233dcd01be2a', E'2025-07-02T21:30:05.894780Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the banana and strawberry into blue bowl', E'Both policies successfully moved one type of fruit (banana for A and strawberry for B) into blue bowl. Policy B tends to respond faster since it picked up two of the fruit and Policy A just tried to do with one and then froze in the remaining time'),
(E'7af3d926-6763-4fcd-8fff-b117dce977d9', E'2025-07-02T21:39:50.568271Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'wash the dishes', E'both policies failed to follow the right direction for the task. They must first pick up the sponge and perform swiping movement on the dish but in both cases, they tried to reach for another objects like dish and bowl first.'),
(E'31186ff5-5714-4d8d-8972-132226c6e974', E'2025-07-02T21:54:05.324048Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the marker in the plate', E'Policy A attempted to grasp the pen which was not the object we aksed for. Policy B attempted to pick up both marker and pen into the plate which is insufficient but at least it completed the task'),
(E'3e4d1fe0-259b-4a94-8ffc-21290c4d359e', E'2025-07-02T22:05:33.027733Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the mustard bottle into bowl', E'Policy A kept being stuck and moving away from the table and did not respond in the remaining time. Policy succesfully put the bottle into bowl and at the same time pushed both of them away off the table.'),
(E'8c8bcdda-9248-407b-a0fc-17d630772c21', E'2025-07-02T22:16:21.391428Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the marker in the box', E'Policy A froze in mid-air the entire session while policy B has successfully grasp the marker on the table; however, it failed to locate the box on the right and kept moving the marker to the right side of the table.'),
(E'f2e3afe7-5615-488f-a8d7-a6738aa92d23', E'2025-07-02T22:27:36.824499Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the sponge on the chair', E'A did slightly better since it at least pointed to the sponge at first but ended up threw it off the table. Policy B tried to moved other object (bottle) onto the chair which was also what policy A did after sponge went disappearing from the scene.'),
(E'dab020cd-5bdc-4b18-b4fb-5167da0740ac', E'2025-07-02T22:52:21.696357Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the strawberry in drawer', E'Both policies failed to address the task critically since they both tried to reach for the pink bowl which was indeed not the fruit we asked it to do something with it.'),
(E'f67bc576-b212-4632-8647-a85807a87c1b', E'2025-07-02T23:00:18.901735Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the cloth in the drawer', E'BOth policies are able to recognized the starting point which is to grasph the green cloth but both policies has performed differently. Policy B attempted to grasp it multiple times but the force was not enough to hold it for long. Policy A on the other hand has moved it on top of the drawer first but then accidently moved it at the rear of the interior of the drawer'),
(E'abeaf1c1-55bb-435a-a00a-7d7893c7b1cc', E'2025-07-02T23:13:02.400179Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put an egg in a plate that contains a bowl on it', E'Both policies did not do so well in both trials. Policy B seemed to not respond to the command and did nothing and  the time it took was longer than A. Policy A at least attempted to move one of the white object that is very similar to the egg to the correct spot but the egg was still remained at the same place after the trial.'),
(E'0ca1ca8d-9118-471a-88fc-4f20c45fbcf4', E'2025-07-02T23:26:09.335341Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'open the drawer', E'Policy A is better since it went one step further and pull the handle of the drawer toward the robot itself. Policy B seemed to be confused what to do next after shifting the arm on the surface of the drawer; its gripper then just opened and closed constantly on the surface of drawer'),
(E'1de15535-caa0-4b88-b091-3f48f3ee18f1', E'2025-07-02T23:45:41.957903Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'remove the scissor from the chair', E'Both policies failed to detect the location of the scissor which was placed on the very left of the scene. Policy A instead reached for the marker while policy B wandered around the fruit collection of the table'),
(E'c12c4455-e161-48cb-80e4-fd3782f81615', E'2025-07-02T23:54:23.492238Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the marker in the drawer', E'Policy B did better since it completed the task nicely without any unncessary steps.'),
(E'6c25a638-6229-474c-8bfc-a266fe46c043', E'2025-07-07T20:57:41.431996Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'clean the whiteboard', E'Both policies attempt to understand the core of the task but failed to pick up the correct object to clean the whiteboard. Due to similar shape, it tried to reach for the colored block instead of the eraser.'),
(E'f78aee8a-f967-4a74-aed5-84839b736279', E'2025-07-07T21:07:37.978216Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the carrot together', E'B is slightly better since the first direction it wanted to reach is towards each of the carrot pieces but eventually these pieces were not picked up properly. Policy A seemed to freeze and grasp at nothing at the edge of the white board in which the carrot laid on.'),
(E'90a0b375-1d07-4b0c-ac21-7b10399b962b', E'2025-07-07T21:16:50.623222Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'organize the cans one straight line', E'Policy B is better off at grasping the cans precisely; however, the progress was not enough to line up these cans in one line. The can still lie down and was not made to stand up properly. Policy A failed to grasp any relevant items required to progress to the next steps.'),
(E'10bc0712-34a7-4e37-929a-cd5c38e7eecb', E'2025-07-07T21:44:18.193773Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'rotate the can in an upright position', E'Both policies failed to interpret the task correctly. It was supposed to pick up the only fallen can and reposition it to stand up right on its base but in both casess, the robot seemed to ignore the fallen one and reach for the standing cans'),
(E'2a6e36ed-f855-4a3f-8732-b5f5b4a39fb7', E'2025-07-07T21:59:20.295243Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the fallen can next to the red can', E'BOth did not perform pretty well since it ignored or misunderstand the task. It should reach for the fallen tomato can on the left but the arm tried to reach for other places except the left side of the scene.'),
(E'9522794f-4493-4ea1-ac9a-b991a1393e5b', E'2025-07-07T22:14:44.928536Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the fork on the bowl', E'Policy A instead moved the spoon to the bowl and did not try another shot on the fork. Policy B recognized the location of the spoon instantly but failed to grasp it properly. It constantly grasped and droped the fork in the air and pushed the spoon away from the rack'),
(E'65e00006-71e6-4edf-af62-7dec377ccb98', E'2025-07-07T22:25:32.243796Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the yellow sponge on the black platform', E'A did better since it only got the sponge while B grasped both the spoon and sponge to the location'),
(E'b9ccb4ae-7ad9-4d3f-b9a6-2c9b0636348a', E'2025-07-07T22:36:09.637051Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the grape onto plate', E'policy B did better since it at least picked up the grape although the action was not fully completed and the trial has stopped in the middle. Policy A took too long to locate the object and thus has not picked up anything'),
(E'b9865ff9-37fe-4046-95a0-072221224f14', E'2025-07-07T22:53:47.304535Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the yellow block onto plate', E'Both policies are doing very well since it correctly moved the yellow cube to the correct location. Both also optimzed the reposition and runtime does not take this long to complete the task'),
(E'369854a0-28f6-4b70-bd3c-a22b7173109b', E'2025-07-09T21:06:34.476227Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeleu'), E'put the marker in drawer', E'A  did better since it has grasped the marker but only landed it on the surface of the drawer. B was completely off since it ended up picking up the red block after trying to handle the marker for a few seconds'),
(E'3887bb45-a04b-4eae-b643-c6a3e2056d14', E'2025-07-09T21:16:31.573502Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeleuy'), E'move the red block on table', E'Both policies just aimed to the red block without succesfully grasping it properly. The arm was rotating left and right but in both cases the block was not picked up out of the drawer.'),
(E'e2c90a86-93d6-4f67-a1b4-694feb560841', E'2025-07-09T21:27:38.207818Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'BERKELEY'), E'PUT THE SPONGE INTO BOWL', E'Policy  B performed better since it successfully found and picked up the sponge but eventually placed it onto the drawer. Policy A was porrly rotating around the drawer without recognizing the location of the black sponge. It also tried to push the drawer away off to gain a better view but still no object was interacted and grasped in this trial.'),
(E'340ac092-c063-428b-8592-708cbaf39948', E'2025-07-09T21:44:39.529536Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'sort out all the markers and put them onto drawer', E'Both policies did not go any further other than picking up just one marker out of 3 markers placed on the table. Time was running short and the robot only attempted one marker for policy A and two markers for B but none of them were placed on the correct spot.'),
(E'bb835e77-c3af-44e6-a1b6-b46c86acf4d8', E'2025-07-09T21:54:26.777444Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the vegetables into bowl', E'B are better since one out of 2 pieces of vegetable are placed into bowl. Policy A detected the wrong object and kept on grasping it the entire time'),
(E'f43db1a7-ed0e-4fbf-9cbf-0e19e4d37600', E'2025-07-09T22:05:12.523825Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'remove the carrot out of the drawer', E'Both policies has completed the task excellently but in B the drawer was taken out separated and the carrot was only removed in last second. A has done it smoothly with all the other things remained intact'),
(E'8b3a2b66-403a-41d4-aecf-01e777cac86c', E'2025-07-09T22:14:38.820666Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the yellow sponge to the left side of the table', E'A was indeed better. Policy B wandered around between objects and did not grasp the requested sponge on the right. A on the other hand has moved the yellow sponge half way to the center but stopped there for a while before heading to the black sponge'),
(E'3827f178-2297-4a8f-92fd-7e65ef233728', E'2025-07-09T22:27:02.743955Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'betkeley'), E'erase the whiteboard', E'Both policies tied as they only grab the eraser but did not perform any erasing movement on the board. Policy A then squeezed the dish sponge after shifting between the eraser.'),
