(E'cbbaee98-5d1b-4b8c-9e38-399102609f6f', E'2025-09-26T09:37:50.668908Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'fold the tissue in half', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the tissue, grasped its right edge, moved it toward left edge of the tissue,causing the tissue to be folded but not in perfect half.Then policy B picked up the tissue and moved it until time ran out.My instruction is to fold the tissue in half, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two,policy B folded the tissue although not in perfect half whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'a844bf19-44e6-412d-8676-3fff6418c25b', E'2025-09-26T13:14:11.642875Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'CoRL 2025 Seoul'), E'pick the tape', E'both failed to move from the beginning'),
(E'c0f1881f-87e6-4193-b9ab-0cbfd37d2a51', E'2025-09-28T01:04:12.239174Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'throw the bottle into the trash can', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B also did not respond to my command and did not take any action at all.My instruction is to throw the bottle into the trash can, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies did not show any response to my instruction.Therefore ,i choose tie.'),
(E'febf9bcd-a936-47f5-a09b-50ff525a0479', E'2025-09-28T01:18:52.549639Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'throw the bottle into the trash can', E'Policy A first slightly moved the gripper back and forth for a while, then stopped during remaining time of the episode.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to throw the bottle into the trash can,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two,policy A at least moved the gripper whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore,policy A is slightly better than policy B.'),
(E'06be1d73-9415-43f0-be7c-e124018c2fd6', E'2025-09-28T01:41:42.078542Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'grasp the cube, then put it into the trash can', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the cube, made several attempts to grasp it, then picked it up, moved it and dropped it on floor in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the cube, attempted to grasped it several times, then picked it up and dropped it on sofa.My instruction is to grasp the cube then put it into the trash can, neither policy was able to compete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both polices only grasped and dropped the cube, but did not put it into the trash can.Therefore,i choose tie.'),
(E'1ef636f7-9ca1-4fbf-9843-a11672bbe7ba', E'2025-09-28T02:11:02.922634Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'close the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book, then moved the gripper away.Next, after hesitating for a while,policy A moved the gripper close to the book again, touched it in the end.Policy B moved the gripper back and forth during most time of the episode,and moved the gripper toward the book in the end, but time ran out.My instruction is to close the book, neither policy was able to complete the task. When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least touched the book whereas policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'a871ba34-7cff-4812-88b0-2809e7b1a1fb', E'2025-09-28T02:38:15.748319Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'open the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book, adjusted posture, pushed the edge of the cover, then grasped the cover and pushed it to make the book open a bit, but then the book closed when the gripper released.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the book, adjusted posture, then moved slowly above the book during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to open the book, neither policy was able to complete the full task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least attempted to open the book while policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
