(E'5c8962ce-7e13-48d8-97bd-72ef6c6f9a3f', E'2025-09-28T03:26:37.901191Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'grasp the towel, then wipe the sofa with the towel', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the towel, grasped it, moved on the sofa left and right as if wiping the sofa, then moved the towel outside the sofa and dropped it on floor.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the towel,attempted to grasp it but did not succeed.Then, after hesitating for a while, policy B approached the towel again, picked it up, moved it outside the sofa and dropped it on floor.My instruction is to grasp the towel then wipe the sofa with the towel,when comparing the performance of the two, policy A completed the task successfully whereas policy B only grasped the towel but did not wipe the sofa with it.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'ffc0c4d2-cca7-47da-aceb-2de29f7ec736', E'2025-09-28T05:23:59.393017Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'fold the towel in half', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B also did not respond to my command and did not take any actions at all.My instruction is to fold the towel in half,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policy did not respond to my instruction.Therefore, i choose tie.'),
