(E'f276d144-3968-4f0f-b1a1-8f47bdfdf54c', E'2025-10-09T08:20:01.009342Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'close the book', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not performed any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the book, pushed it, then moved slightly above the book for a while.Next, policy B adjusted posture, approach the edge of book as if attempting to close the book but time ran out.My instruction is to close the book, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least identified the book and attempted to close it whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'8b9807bf-d26a-46f5-be0d-1dd13fce2557', E'2025-10-09T08:34:21.716002Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'open the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper randomly for a while, then stopped during remaining time of the episode.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to open the book, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least moved the gripper whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is slightly better than policy B.'),
