(E'7787c2c2-be1d-45a4-95de-dcfa59e44ec2', E'2025-10-09T09:58:48.187715Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'throw the packaging bag into the trash can', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the trash can,grasped and released the edge of the trash can, then approached the packaging bag, picked it up, moved it toward the trash can but then moved away in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper randomly for a while, then approached the trash can and grasped the edge of the  trash can, causing it to be tipped over.My instruction is to throw the packaging bag into the trash can, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least picked up the packaging bag and moved it toward the trash can, whereas policy B did not identify the packaging bag.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
