(E'4f92493e-d118-482d-a717-60deddb8ccb8', E'2025-10-14T02:47:19.133982Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the pillow', E'Policy A moved the gripper back and forth during most time of the episode, as if could not find the target.Policy B also moved the gripper randomly during  the whole trial, as if could not find the target.My instruction is to pick up the pillow, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies only moved the gripper but did not find the target.Therefore, i choose tie.'),
(E'f248e201-1ba2-4438-9744-6c60e1d43b1b', E'2025-10-14T03:00:26.610832Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the pillow', E'Policy A first moved the gripper randomly during most time of the episode, then seemingly attempted to approached the pillow but time ran out.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the pillow, touched it as if attempting to grasp it, then policy B moved the gripper away and moved randomly during remaining time of the trial.My instruction is to pick up the pillow,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least attempted to grasp the pillow whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'fa568302-1336-46ea-9beb-991ac60a5191', E'2025-10-14T03:15:26.110536Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the banana onto the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the banana, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it and dropped it on floor.Next, policy A approached the banana again and attempted to grasp it until time ran out.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the banana,then made multiple attempts to grasp it during most time of the episode,  picked it up in the end.My instruction is to put the banana onto the book, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A picked up the banana smoothly and moved it whereas policy B only picked up the banana.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'28d46c06-9027-45e7-91d6-6b9c3074135b', E'2025-10-14T03:44:19.683631Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'close the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book, adjusted posture, insert the gripper under the cover of the book, pushed the cover to make the book closed.Then policy A moved the gripper away and moved slightly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the book, adjusted posture, insert the gripper under the cover of the book, pushed the cover to make the book closed.Then policy B moved the gripper away and moved randomly until stopped in the end.My instruction is to close the book, both policies have completed the task successfully, when comparing the performance of the two, both policies have finished the task smoothly and their performance was similar.Therefore, i choose tie.'),
(E'9a6cf2e7-a33b-4e0d-a870-1c5d0c6a2499', E'2025-10-14T05:18:55.951985Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'open the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book but moved away soon, after hesitating for a while, then policy A approached the  book again, grasp the edge of the book and attempted to open it,but time ran out.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the book, adjusted posture, grasped the edge of the book, moved it to make the book opened halfway, but the book closed when the gripper moved away.My instruction is to open the book, when comparing the performance of the two, policy B almost completed the task whereas policy A only attempted to open the book.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'db430215-9abe-465c-9ec6-eb46a7119028', E'2025-10-14T05:40:16.582609Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'touch the English word on the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book, then moved back and forth toward the book until time ran out.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the book, closed the gripper, touched the English word on the book.Then, after hesitating for a while, policy B touch the book again.My instruction it to touch the English word on the book, when comparing the performance of the two, policy B completed the task successfully, whereas policy A failed.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
