(E'90364e82-853c-407b-8a24-557898423901', E'2025-10-22T03:23:24.776313Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the cube onto the book', E'Policy A moved the gripper randomly during most time of the episode, then approached the cube but moved away soon.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the cube, attempted to grasped it, picked it up, then moved it and dropped it on floor.My instruction is to put the cube onto the book,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked up the cube and moved it, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
