(E'2bd8bd96-31bd-4fe6-8e6a-1d9d8f404427', E'2025-10-22T07:42:29.343925Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the marker pen into the plate', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the marker pen, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it to the plate, put it into the plate.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operation at all.My instruction is to put the marker pen into the plate,when comparing the performance of the two, policy A completed the task successfully, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'233a2e87-5eca-4a2a-8ae4-fa67f2758c6e', E'2025-10-22T07:55:15.575577Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'turn the plate upside down', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the plate but moved away soon, then policy B moved the gripper randomly for a while and approached the plate again in the end.My instruction is to turn the plate upside down,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least approached the plate, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'ea7bdfd0-85f4-4e8c-8628-f99752da0fb2', E'2025-10-22T08:12:34.647968Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'knock over the bottle of water', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the bottle of water but moved away soon,then, paused briefly, moved the gripper toward the sofa in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the bottle but moved away soon,then moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to knock over the bottle of water, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least moved the gripper close to the bottle of water, whereas policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is slightly better than policy B.'),
(E'3d251402-9295-4ca9-99a7-8cac7ad6a03a', E'2025-10-22T08:34:26.074185Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the bottle of water, don''t release it', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the bottle of water, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it and dropped it on floor.Policy B first moved the gripper randomly during most time of the episode, then moved the gripper toward the bottle of water but moved away soon.My instruction is to pick up the bottle of water and don''t release it, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A picked up the bottle but released it in the end, whereas policy B did not pick up the bottle.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
