(E'c16c7631-4b9e-427b-9849-ff8c4e94a392', E'2025-10-22T20:36:33.711986Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move scissors to the junk box', E'B rotate the twist in a very weird position after having spotted on the plate at first. The arm ended up being 360 degrees rotation from its intitial position but the gripper has not intended to reach for the scissor. On the other hand, A succeeded in grasping the scissors but it dropped it right at the edge of the table and sliding down on the floor; however the direction tended to target the drawer not the junk box'),
(E'7157ff86-a698-409a-8936-e3588d2c9883', E'2025-10-22T20:49:40.889184Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the mask into wooden drawer', E'A completely went off since it approached the junk box and tried to search for the mask in this area meanwhile the mask located at the opposite direction. B did a little better since it just sticked to the left area where we put the medical mask ; the arm at some points almost touched the mask but then it kept rotated and searched around until time ran off'),
(E'61b9b6e6-0bd3-4f46-b74d-a9d8af04274f', E'2025-10-22T20:59:02.937982Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'make strawberry cupcake by placing the fruit on top', E'Both A and B did not do very well, They could not even recognize the location of the strawberry which sit on the cup and it is apparently visible, A tended to move the cup all around and B just focused on how to rotate the cupcake in a right position without even note to reach for the fruit'),
(E'deee1a12-5655-45dd-92d3-e770faae4c50', E'2025-10-22T21:12:36.015254Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'use the spoon to spread the jam to bread', E'Policy A and B did not do well. A tried to reach for soemthing in between the bread and the spoon while B just manipulated things in the gray tray while everything we asked for located at the white tray'),
(E'eb5f2e6b-7ecb-4c59-8ff5-e4f0d9044ee0', E'2025-10-22T21:24:55.811483Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'sort  the non office essential out of the plate', E'Policy A completed ther task within the very first few orientation since it sorted out the spoon out of the three objects and the spoon is indeed not belonging to the office. B chose the clipper to interact with and this got removed from the plate despite being an office stuff'),
(E'c9ebb187-dd1a-4ec0-b255-05b9d5a0be33', E'2025-10-22T21:40:07.662783Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'drop the cable on the chair', E'policy A searched up around the plate which is just beneath the cable, but it ended up grasping nothing and moved over the chair, showing that it knew to do something with the chair after all. B succeeded in moving the cable from the tray but the gripper dropeed it near the chair and went down on the floor when the camera could not capture this'),
(E'398a428f-e505-4540-ab6c-759d0f8d430d', E'2025-10-22T21:56:34.244729Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the plate on the chair, do not drop anything', E'A and B both reached for the plate but did not perform a significant movement can alter the arrangment of these objects. A at some points had the ability the lift the plate up air but it dropped it immediately. B did even worse since it just hovered around the plate and did not even touch upon anything'),
(E'21c15162-523b-438c-88b6-91f8af0bc670', E'2025-10-22T22:17:23.763483Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the spoon next to the scissors', E'Both policies did not score perfectly. B grasped the spoon but it did not find the location of the scissors; the arm ened up dropping it in the direction near the destination we required. A followed the same pattern except it grasped nothing and shifted over to the white tray'),
