(E'22074684-725a-4070-a847-adab792b97d0', E'2025-10-30T07:26:12.917072Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'erase the words in the book with the eraser', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the eraser, grasped and released it, then, after hesitating for while, approached the book in the end.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to erase the words in the book with the eraser,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least grasped the eraser, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'9220aca1-da2a-4451-ad97-f2fd7f3aa033', E'2025-10-30T07:39:24.213102Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stand the bottle up', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the bottle, then pushed it slowly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the bottle, then moved slowly above the bottle for a while and stopped during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to stand the bottle up, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least pushed the bottle, whereas policy B did not even touch the bottle.Therefore, policy A is better than policy.'),
(E'0ee40873-d98e-48b3-ac02-63396a25281a', E'2025-10-30T08:33:24.247432Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the two wrench together', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to one wrench, then made multiple attempts to grasp it during remaining time of the episode, but did not succeed in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the book, grasped and released it, then approached one wrench, attempted to grasp it but did not succeed.My instruction is to put the two wrench together, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies have attempted to grasp the wrench, but policy A touched the wrench while policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is slightly better than policy B.'),
(E'4eb61678-639d-46a8-a5e3-14b0870e7d0d', E'2025-10-30T08:45:26.923859Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'arrange the two wrenches in the shape of a cross', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the eraser on the book, grasped and released it, then moved around the book during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper toward one wrench but moved away soon, then policy B moved the gripper close to a bottle, pushed it to the wrench in the end.My instruction is to arrange the two wrenches in the shape of a cross,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least approached one wrench, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'b4ce63b8-44e3-4502-8977-b1ea7f32542f', E'2025-10-30T08:59:59.862529Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the two batteries end to end', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book, attempted to grasp it, then moved slowly around the book during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to one battery, attempted to grasped it but did not succeed, then, after hesitating for a while, picked up the battery, moved it and dropped it on floor in the end.My instruction is to put the two batteries end to end,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked up one battery, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'6ab64d77-9b50-4fc5-9779-32c9635901ae', E'2025-10-30T09:09:36.444303Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'throw the bottle into the trash can', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the bottle, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it and dropped it on floor.Next, policy A moved the gripper randomly until approached the curtain.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the bottle, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it slightly and dropped it on sofa.Next, policy B attempted to grasp the bottle again, but time ran out.My instruction is to throw the bottle into the trash can, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies picked up and moved the bottle, but policy A moved the bottle more obviously than policy B did.Therefore, policy A is slightly better than policy B.'),
(E'4e108d4f-ff79-4003-ae6e-83bc704a44f3', E'2025-10-30T09:34:32.572639Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'fold the towel in half', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the towel, then closed and opened the gripper several times above the towel during most time of the episode,as if attempting to grasped it but did not succeed in the end.My instruction is to fold the towel in half, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least attempted to grasp the towel, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'53f0f00f-9bfa-4a28-8f1c-086cf83bfd4d', E'2025-11-03T01:14:21.042757Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'fold the towel in half', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the towel, grasped the bottom right corner of the towel, picked it up, then moved it for a while, dropped it on sofa in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the towel, made multiple attempts to grasp the bottom left corner of the towel during entire time of the episode, but did not succeed in the end.My instruction is to fold the towel in half,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least picked up and moved the towel, whereas policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'8ffc0a4c-cfd8-44ae-89ba-fd304f9f1f32', E'2025-11-03T01:27:43.642844Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'grasp the bottom left corner of the towel and move it to top right corner', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the towel, approached the bottom left corner, grasped and released it, then moved the gripper away and approached the bottom right corner in then end.Policy B first moved the gripper toward floor near the bottom left corner of the towel, then stopped during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to grasp the bottom left corner of the towel and move it to top right corner,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least grasped the bottom left corner of the towel, whereas policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'0c63db1f-3271-4350-86f0-ea14bf4262f1', E'2025-11-03T01:44:15.304870Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'press the yellow button of the remote control', E'Policy A first closed the gripper, moved the gripper toward the remote control,  hovered above the remote control for while, then moved the gripper away in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper above the remote control, closed the gripper, then moved slight during remaining time of the episode, as if attempting to press the remote control.My instruction is press the yellow button of the remote control,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies approached the remote control, but policy B seemingly attempted to press the remote control while policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is slightly better than policy A.'),
(E'd905ecfa-0b70-4e0d-ab64-759e183cc785', E'2025-11-03T01:56:50.574602Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'wrap the remote control in a towel', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the remote control, attempted to grasp it but did not succeed, then policy B moved the gripper back and forth during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to wrap the remote control in a towel, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least attempted to grasp the remote control, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
