(E'ba541648-0282-4f5d-9e73-7707e5d10add', E'2025-11-03T02:36:35.246574Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put all the fruit into the plate', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the red block, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the plate and dropped it into the plate.Next,policy B approached the marker pen, grasped it, picked it up in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the red block, grasped and released it, then closed and opened the gripper above the red block several times  during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is put all the fruit into the plate, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies grasped the red block which is wrong object, but policy A put the red block into the plate while policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'ab405a15-557d-42a8-b1b9-75d018f160c3', E'2025-11-03T02:48:02.720171Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'cover the banana with the plate', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the plate, then closed and opened the gripper several times during most time of the episode as if attempting to grasp the plate, but did not succeed in the end.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to cover the banana with the plate, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least attempted to grasp the plate, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'ab469752-16d4-4aba-aad8-cc84368f8b86', E'2025-11-03T03:12:58.002116Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the brush', E'Policy A moved the gripper back and forth during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the brush, made multiple attempts to grasp it during the whole trial,but did not succeed in the end.My instruction is to pick up the brush, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least attempted to grasp the brush, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'bfc33c09-c75c-4f8f-bf87-d977b04ca37f', E'2025-11-03T03:28:40.642715Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'wash the plate with the brush', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the plate, then moved slowly above the plate during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the marker pen, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the plate and dropped it into the plate.Next, policy B moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to wash the plate with the brush, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies did not find the brush, but policy B at least put a wrong object into the plate while policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'c51bd95a-2685-42ac-9ce2-6138357c65c5', E'2025-11-03T03:41:41.220942Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'turn the plate upside down', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first adjusted posture, moved the gripper close to the plate, grasped the edge of the plate, picked it up, then moved it and dropped it on sofa, but did not succeed in turning it upside down.My instruction is to turn the plate upside down, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked up and moved the plate, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'5bb71b3c-4399-484d-9940-38a291cd172b', E'2025-11-03T05:35:04.882703Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'take off the cap of the marker pen', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the marker pen, then moved back and forth during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first took some time to find the target, moved the gripper close to the marker pen, attempted to grasped it but did not succeed.Then policy B moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to take off the cap of the marker pen,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least attempted to grasp the marker pen, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is slightly better than policy A.'),
(E'001e18de-cdb1-48d8-aac1-d2e3ce096d01', E'2025-11-03T06:39:56.297040Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the paper into the plate', E'Policy A moved the gripper randomly, closed and opened the gripper several times during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.Policy B first moved the gripper slightly, then stopped during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to put the paper into the plate,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least moved the gripper during whole trial, whereas policy B almost stopped.Therefore, policy A is slightly better than policy B.'),
(E'8c6c3799-d3da-44c0-ad3b-d83e9c129051', E'2025-11-03T06:58:01.036505Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'cover the remote control with the paper', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the sofa, attempted to grasp the edge of the sofa, then moved the gripper away and moved randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to cover the remote control with the paper,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least moved the gripper, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'5bb5390b-1f1e-44d5-bf56-fbc91672aa90', E'2025-11-03T07:07:06.987777Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'wipe the plate with the paper', E'Policy A first moved the gripper slightly for a while, then almost stopped during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the paper, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it and dropped it near the plate.Next, policy B grasped the paper again, picked it up and dropped it in the end.My instruction is to wipe the plate with the paper,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least moved the paper close to the plate, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'651ea210-a004-4473-8935-6cfec6844651', E'2025-11-03T07:31:07.662905Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the pencil into the cup', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the pencil, attempted to grasped it several times, then picked it up with a wooden block, moved it and dropped it on floor.Next, policy A moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to put the pencil into the cup, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least picked up and moved the pencil, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'9d032194-5dc3-4ad6-b4a1-3ecada697d32', E'2025-11-03T07:50:35.671567Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'knock the cup over', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the cup, grasped and released it, then moved the gripper away and moved randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to knock the cup over, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least grasped the cup, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'11d2a26a-1e9a-4913-876c-d0e09005ae92', E'2025-11-03T08:21:58.734949Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stand the cup upright', E'Policy A first rotated the gripper and moved randomly for a while, then stopped during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the cup, pushed the edge of the cup, then moved the gripper away and moved slightly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to stand the cup upright,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least pushed the cup, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'68fc59af-f49c-4ef5-8205-872fd6596242', E'2025-11-03T08:31:10.560750Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stack up the two cups', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to one cup, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward another cup and dropped it near another cup, causing the two cups to fall over.Policy B first moved the gripper close to one cup, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it to another cup, stacked up the two cups, although made the two cups fall over.My instruction is to stack up the two cups, when comparing the performance of the two, policy B completed the task successfully, whereas policy A failed.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'569a6f7a-9559-4349-8f13-0bc44610d2ec', E'2025-11-03T09:49:15.816904Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'close the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book, pushed the edge of one page of the book to another side, but the page returned back when the gripper moved away.Policy B first moved the gripper randomly during most time of the episode, as if could not find the target, then stopped near the corner of the table in the end.My instruction is to close the book, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least attempted to close the book, whereas policy B did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'11fac2f4-2039-498e-9d75-683a7721fd21', E'2025-11-03T21:25:36.642995Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'use the whiteboard eraser to clean the board', E'A correctly detected the whiteboard eraser on the left and ligered around this area during the session; the gripper did not eventually grasp the eraser in place; Policy B mistakenly grasped the other eraser on the right and perform a wiping motion'),
(E'0d7fa5da-903c-4b4f-9d26-dc92f5c9be95', E'2025-11-03T21:45:52.055304Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkreley'), E'close the top drawer', E'both policies successfully closed the intended drawer; Both unintentionally closed both the top and bottom drawer. A reached for the bottom first while B reached'),
(E'f76e2107-63a0-4251-adc4-de32ddf77761', E'2025-11-03T22:10:45.824669Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the corn into drawer', E'Both policies did badly since A just reached for the container that contains the corn. it did not grasp anything eventually. B did a bit better since it was able to grasp the carrot but still it was not the intended corn we asked for.'),
(E'1a8c549a-3d92-44a5-a983-2e3ad7d25d69', E'2025-11-03T22:34:09.494053Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the red block in the drawr and close it', E'B did not move at all from its initial position while A at least attempted to rach for the red block but failed to grasp it in place'),
(E'3dd30097-82fe-4485-bca6-57e1f9754583', E'2025-11-03T22:57:11.233984Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the carrot on the bread', E'Both policies just reached the carrot and grasped it to the left edge of the table. They followed a similar pattern and completely ignored the bread which placed in the middle of the seen'),
(E'07415db0-bf56-41da-8349-6ec4d9f91b3f', E'2025-11-03T23:14:53.193532Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the banana into drawer', E'B moved the arm inwards to the base of the robot and did not move regarding to the task command. A has succesfully moved the banana into drawer as intended without a single irrelevant movement'),
(E'a94e75a3-f4e0-4f4a-bfd6-84112321b740', E'2025-11-03T23:46:32.030901Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the eraser into drawer', E'A moved towards the eraser but was ont sure if it had the first intention since the eraser is located in the middle of everything; it then grasped nothing and shifted over to the drawer. B was succeeded in getting the eraser into the drawe just in time before the time clocked in'),
(E'cc2e2ce4-4c96-409b-9bad-a694a383dee2', E'2025-11-04T01:12:46.673825Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'rotate the marker pen by 90 degrees', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the marker pen, attempted to grasp it several times but did not succeed, then policy A moved the gripper away and moved randomly until time ran out.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the marker pen, then moved slow around the marker during the whole trial, attempted to grasp the marker but did not succeed, only touched the marker pen.My instruction is to rotate the marker pen by 90 degrees,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least touched the marker pen, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'd9531f3c-48d0-4a2f-a846-0eef2a740f64', E'2025-11-04T01:23:17.553890Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'close the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book, touched the edge of the cover for a while, then inserted the gripper under the cover, pushed it slightly as if attempting to close the book, but time ran out.Policy B first moved the gripper back and forth for a while, then approached the book, adjusted posture,grasped the pages of the book, lifted them up a bit, but time ran out.My instruction is to close the book, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A inserted the gripper under the cover and pushed the cover, whereas policy B grasped the pages rather then cover.Policy A seems more likely to complete this task than policy B.Therefore, i prefer policy A.'),
(E'c3528ad9-26d2-4acc-ace9-bd7ea9d25334', E'2025-11-04T01:51:38.853834Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'erase the words in the book with the eraser', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B moved the gripper slightly during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.My instruction is to erase the words in the book with the eraser, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least moved the gripper, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'82f8c230-81b6-4725-b75d-c73790ca685d', E'2025-11-04T02:03:23.427892Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the eraser onto the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the eraser, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the book and put it onto the book.Next, policy A moved the gripper away and moved slightly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the eraser but moved away soon, then policy B moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to put the eraser onto the book, when comparing the performance of the two, policy A completed the task successfully, whereas policy B failed.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'60121e0c-732f-40cd-b2f8-ba5041f3a803', E'2025-11-04T02:23:23.161898Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'turn the book upside down', E'Policy A moved the gripper slightly during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.Policy B first took some time to find the target, then moved the gripper close to the book, adjusted posture, inserted the gripper under the book, grasped and released it several times.Next, policy B grasped the corner of  the book, lifted it up, as if attempting the turn the book upside down, but time ran out.My instruction is to turn the book upside down, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least grasped the book and attempted to turn it upside down, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'd44695dc-9752-41b8-a7b7-b3ec60ff13c6', E'2025-11-04T02:37:54.515350Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stand the spray bottle upright', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the spray bottle, adjusted posture, grasped the spray bottle,picked it up,rotated the spray bottle to stand it almost upright, then dropped it on sofa in the end,causing it to fall over.Policy B moved the gripper randomly during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.My instruction is to stand the spray bottle upright, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A almost completed the task, whereas policy B did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'71745ac0-7711-4598-8d50-42eab188da87', E'2025-11-04T02:51:42.016118Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'press the spray bottle to spray', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the spray bottle, closed and opened the gripper several times around the nozzle of the spray bottle during most time of the episode, but did not press the nozzle, only touched the nozzle.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to press the spray bottle to spray, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least touched the nozzle of the spray bottle, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'9c42ae76-7496-44eb-94f0-962ac8451f92', E'2025-11-04T03:10:17.971303Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the cap back on the spray bottle', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the curtain, attempted to grasp it, then approached the sofa and moved slightly around the edge of the sofa until time ran out.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the cap of the spray bottle, grasped it, but the cap slipped off when being lifted up. Then policy B moved the gripped back and forth for a while, and attempted to grasp the cap again in the end.My instruction is to put the cap back on the spray bottle,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least grasped the cap of spray bottle, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'b8bceeda-47c2-416c-b755-31087cf67ab6', E'2025-11-04T03:33:33.454050Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'squeeze the sponge', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the sponge, closed and opened the gripper several times above the sponge, then moved the gripper away and moved slight for a while, approached the sponge again and touched the edge of the sponge in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the sponge as if attempting to grasp it, but moved away soon, then, after hesitating for a while, approached the sponge a again in the end.My instruction is to squeeze the sponge,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least touched the sponge, whereas policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'c18879a0-b132-43f4-9f71-840623ceda18', E'2025-11-04T03:45:02.246580Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'wipe the sofa with the sponge', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the sponge, grasped and release it, then,after hesitating for a while, grasped the sponge again, picked it up, moved it until time ran out.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the sponge but moved away soon, then policy B moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to wipe the sofa with the sponge, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least grasped and moved the sponge, whereas policy B did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'8ecada9e-a925-4ada-9fbd-04e5d8e3ae96', E'2025-11-04T05:21:27.173659Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the remote control onto the sponge', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operation at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the remote control, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it and dropped it on floor.Next, policy B moved the gripper away and moved randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to put the remote control onto the sponge, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked up the remote control, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'c642b1cb-e3cd-48b3-84e3-c1d43e7ba655', E'2025-11-04T05:54:32.003772Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'press the yellow button of the remote control', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the sponge rather than the remote control,attempted to press the sponge, then moved slowly above the sponge during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the remote control, closed the gripper, pressed the blank area of the remote control, then moved the gripper away and moved slightly until approached the remote control again in the end.My instruction is to press the yellow button of the remote control,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two,policy B at least press the blank area of the remote control, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'a6e9b82e-01d8-45e0-98b0-f772d3811d9d', E'2025-11-04T06:18:00.373755Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the remote control into the cup', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the cup, attempted to grasp it, but pushed the cup to make it fall over, then policy A moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the remote control, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the cup and dropped it on floor.My instruction is to put the remote control into the cup,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked up and moved the remote control, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'807fe156-f315-4285-b0b3-8d5b2645c9cf', E'2025-11-04T06:41:50.026877Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the bunch of  grapes into the cup', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the sponge, attempted to grasp it, then approached the cup but moved away soon.Next, policy B moved slightly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to put the bunch of  grapes into the cup,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at leas approached the cup, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefor, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'155dc04f-71cb-4ed9-8790-e324e6d0bf5d', E'2025-11-04T07:07:39.791904Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pour water from the cup to the plate', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the cup, grasped  and released the edge of the cup, causing the cup to fall over. Then policy A approached the cup again, attempted to grasp it until time ran out.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to pour water from the cup to the plate,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least grasp the cup, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'915cdca3-2557-4792-80cd-2a2e71a2798d', E'2025-11-08T19:39:14.963213Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'put the carrot on the plate and the corn in the bowl', E'Policy A seemed to have a strong tendency to just pick up whatever was in front of the wrist camera. It for the most part ignored the language instruction, picking up the blue block (which wasn''t one of the objects I mentioned) and the carrot and putting them both on the plate. It got the carrot on the plate correct though, which is half of the instrcution. Policy B was better able to follow the language instruction -- from the objects on the table it correctly identified which one was the carrot and which was the corn. It however placed both the corn and the carrot on the plate, which indicates a failure to follow the latter half of the language instruction.'),
(E'cfb90562-2edd-457c-b950-439c53a60cee', E'2025-11-10T22:43:20.533814Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'pick up the toothbrush', E'A indeed did better since it moved towards the brush and grasped it multiple ties evn though the marker was pushed off the seen. B also reached for the two objects but it got the marker instead and the two has very similar shape'),
(E'a95e57e9-d246-4ccb-9323-5cb33445ccb2', E'2025-11-10T22:59:25.909078Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'use the sponge to clear the marble baord', E'A did better since the arm has a clear intention to reach for the sponge; it grasped atthe edge of the sponge and slowly moved it to the marble. The sponge was dragged left and right slightly but did not imply enough force to clear the letter on the marble. B on the other hand just reached for other objects (marker and brush) and ignored the sponge which is clearly visible'),
(E'3a284d26-967b-42ba-9199-fd581d2cceae', E'2025-11-10T23:09:50.255860Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'pick up the paper trash and move it to bin', E'Policy B gradually lowered its gripper towards the table and thus did not perform any movements relevant to the set up. A at least tried to reach for the paper crumbs after pushed the pot off the ground; the arm was very close to the paper but failed to grasp it on tight'),
(E'81e90fcf-2bff-444b-af1c-602b504fea92', E'2025-11-10T23:20:48.744710Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'write letter O on the notebook', E'A and B followed the same pattern since it grasped the marker and did not do anything afterwards. the notebook was always got pushed further away from the camera'),
(E'04eb662f-6ee5-46c5-b229-ab0fa06bd715', E'2025-11-10T23:38:24.499235Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'stack the smaller bowl into bigger bowl', E'policy A reached for the two bowls but was not sure which should be interacted first; it then picked up the white, bigger bowl and pushed to towards the smaller bowl. Policy B slightly better since it repeated the same movements but it shifted to the smaller bowl and picked it up to the center of the seen, which showed the correct ordered of the task'),
(E'96facaa1-5463-4322-82b1-9e7dca503153', E'2025-11-10T23:52:41.469662Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'put the notebook onto textbook', E'BOth policy A and B have stucked at grasping the notebook tightly and they kept drop[ing it on the table in many different ways . The gripper should shift horizontally and grasped it as the gripper did not loosen. Both policies showed that the gripper just slightly touched the notebook on the edge and then shift it vettically onto it'),
(E'475ae861-219a-4659-992b-41696f67874a', E'2025-11-11T00:05:56.310366Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'remove the cloth from the cup', E'policy B did nothing since it responded by slowly knocked down to the base. A at least reached for the cloth and struggled to grasp it in place; the cup was pushed further away to the right while the cloth still remained on top of it'),
(E'60e47db3-4b47-4a45-881e-96ec685d2877', E'2025-11-11T01:18:48.258139Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'turn the plate upside down', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the plate, adjusted posture, attempted to grasp the plate several times but did not succeed.Then policy A moved the gripper slowly above the plate during remaining time of the episode.Policy B moved the gripper slightly during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.My instruction is to turn the plate upside down,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least attempted to grasp the plate, whereas policy B did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'db17913c-e226-42a9-b43c-e0c83393d474', E'2025-11-11T01:38:01.502516Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'Put the carrot in the drawer.', E'Policy A intially went to try to grab the lid but changed when it was close to apporuching it and changed directions to picking the carrot up. Afterward, it picked up the carrot successfully but dropped the carrot onto the floor and not the drawer. However, policy B did not pick up the carrot at all and only approuched picking up the green towel instead of the carrot.'),
(E'1bdde3ee-b52e-4d53-a3d8-ac7a2ccdb800', E'2025-11-11T01:48:46.372816Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'Put the green towel into the bowl', E'Both policies were unable to reach or pick up the green towel. Interestingly, both policies went to pick up the blue cube instead of picking up the green towel. They both equally were unsuccessful in similar ways.'),
(E'e2732026-6e1e-4507-931a-7a5cf1fa4f64', E'2025-11-11T01:56:24.076900Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'Put the blue cube onto the plate', E'Both policies successfully picked up the blue cube and put it onto the plate.'),
(E'322d2466-b3ff-4b1c-9fe9-c98eea9d640d', E'2025-11-11T02:10:07.519360Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'Put the bread on the plate', E'Both policies were aiming towards picking up the bread. However, they were unsuccessful in picking it up after many attempts  grabbing it. Most likely the object is too flat and there isn''t enouggrabable surface area to pick up the bread.'),
(E'038ffd6d-9721-42dc-b9ee-cc173b2d2ad7', E'2025-11-11T02:25:15.414980Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'Put the bread into the toaster', E'Policy A marginally did better than Policy B because it continiously tried picking up the bread but couldn''t find the right grip for it. Whereas, Policy B was less sucessful because although it did try to pick up the bread, it gave up and got distracted by other objects and went moving around to areas unrelated to the bread.'),
(E'86fabaad-3f98-4862-9865-f5abb75488d1', E'2025-11-11T02:35:52.197421Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'Put the carrot in the blue bowl', E'Policy A got distracted by the red bowl and continiously attempted to move that around while never going near the carrot. Policy B attempted to grab the carrot but struggled, pushing a lot of other objects in order to try to grab the carrot.'),
(E'22abdf59-5952-4872-a24d-8df736888a31', E'2025-11-11T02:48:53.946754Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'Put the mug in the dishwasher', E'Policy A approuched the Mug but was struggling to pick it up. Policy B became distracted in picking up the mug and was unsuccesful in even going towards it. Policy A tried while Policy B was unable to get close to the mug.'),
(E'2f7751cc-1f60-42ec-b44c-ca076a208af9', E'2025-11-11T08:14:34.069797Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stand the cup upright', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the cup, pushed it,grasped it, rotated it to make the cup stand upright.Then policy A moved the gripper away and moved randomly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the plate rather than the cup, closed the gripper as if attempting the grasp the plate, but did not succeed.Then policy B approached the cup in the end.My instruction is to stand the cup upright, when comparing the performance of the two, policy A completed the task successfully, whereas policy B failed.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'157bb77b-42d1-4118-b9ae-ed522de1243d', E'2025-11-11T08:24:31.074184Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the plate onto the cup', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to plate, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the cup, dropped it near the cup, causing the cup to fall over.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the plate, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the cup, dropped it near the cup, causing the cup to fall over.Next, policy B picked the plate again in then end.My instruction is to put the plate onto the cup, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies dropped the plate near the cup, but policy B picked up the plate again in the end while policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is slightly better than policy A.'),
(E'67b95651-5f96-47b2-baf6-9bd4431384a2', E'2025-11-11T08:38:35.911245Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'wipe the sofa with the towel', E'Policy A first moved gripper close to the towel, attempted to grasp it but did not succeed.Then policy A moved the gripper away and moved randomly for a while,approached the towel again, grasped the it, moved it on the surface of the sofa, as if wiping the sofa.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the towel, grasped and released it.Then policy B moved the gripper away and moved randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to wipe the sofa with the towel, when comparing the performance of the two, policy A completed the task successfully, whereas policy B failed.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'1b059532-8b70-4b6f-9ec0-193033796d00', E'2025-11-11T08:49:17.533726Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'fold the towel in half', E'Policy A first moved gripper close to the towel, approached the bottom right corner of the towel, made multiple attempts to grasped it, then grasped the corner, moved it to right to make the towel fold although not in perfectly half. Policy B moved the gripper randomly during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the towel.My instruction is to fold the towel in half, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A almost completed the task, whereas policy B did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'1722765e-bb72-4c2b-93a8-e5dc9a735325', E'2025-11-11T09:03:17.706909Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'cover the controller withe the towel', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the towel, grasped it, lifted it up and released it,then picked the towel up, moved it during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to cover the controller with the towel,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked up and moved the towel, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'5516c5a5-f19a-43f8-b787-46a053f97042', E'2025-11-11T09:15:27.225009Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'touch the display screen of  the controller', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the controller, closed the gripper, as if attempted to touched it.Then after hesitating for a while, touched the blank area of the controller.My instruction is to touch the display screen of  the controller, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance o the two, policy B at least touched the controller, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'a7b811fa-449c-44e4-a501-745da216a53a', E'2025-11-11T09:32:14.061404Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'press the yellow button of the controller', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the controller,closed the gripper, approached the yellow button, press the yellow button.Then policy A moved the gripper away and moved randomly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper above the controller but moved away soon.Then policy B moved the gripper back and forth for a while, approached the controller, closed the gripper as if attempted to press it, but time ran out.My instruction is to press the yellow button of the controller, when comparing the performance of the two, policy A completed the task successfully, whereas policy B failed.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'022545af-35f1-4929-9693-16a3ab31facc', E'2025-11-11T09:46:36.673166Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'turn the controller upside down', E'Policy  A first moved the gripper toward the controller but moved away soon, then moved slightly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to turn the controller upside down,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least moved the gripper, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is slightly better than policy B.'),
(E'daf328fb-334f-4021-88e1-a18a232796f9', E'2025-11-11T16:48:52.526122Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'CIIRC, CTU in Prague'), E'Empty out the pitcher', E'Both policies failed to solve the task. Both policies spent the entire time trying to grab onto either the top or the handle of the pitcher, but both were failing to do so. Policy A was at least closer to actually grabbing the pitcher, while policy B was just grabbing onto nothing most of the time.'),
(E'0ef882c1-200a-49aa-bad6-ee63dc6f25ad', E'2025-11-12T01:01:31.354995Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'rotate the controller by 90 degrees', E'Policy  A first moved the gripper close to the controller, attempted to grasp it but did not succeed, then, after hesitating for a while,  grasped and released the controller, without rotating it.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the controller but moved away soon,  then policy B moved the gripper back and forth during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to rotate the controller by 90 degrees, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the  performance of the two, policy A at least grasped the controller, whereas policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'dea549ee-e737-4a3a-958c-4679278448f5', E'2025-11-12T01:17:49.807211Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'cut the banana with the knife', E'Policy  A moved the gripper back and forth during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the knife, attempted ti grasp it but did not succeed.Then policy B moved the gripper away and moved slightly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to cut the banana with the knife, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least attempted to grasp the knife, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant..Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'08c6c569-7010-41e5-9a17-b800652753ca', E'2025-11-12T01:34:28.573538Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the knife and use the knife to cut the banana', E'Policy  A first moved the gripper toward the knife but moved away soon, then moved the gripper back and forth for a while, approached the knife but did not attempted to pick it up.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the knife but moved away soon, then policy B moved the gripper randomly during most time of the episode and approached the knife again in the end.My instruction is to pick up the knife and use the knife to cut the banana, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies only approached the knife but did not pick it up.Therefore, i choose tie.'),
(E'ef953b66-c55c-4c3a-a1e5-103f0fcab345', E'2025-11-12T01:52:34.258896Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the banana into the cup', E'Policy  A first moved the gripper close to the banana, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the cup, rotated the banana to make it stand upright, dropped it near the cup.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to put the banana into the cup, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least moved the banana near the cup, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'3f2c60eb-bf24-458e-9388-3920c16b4a2d', E'2025-11-12T02:12:33.466341Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the banana from the cup, then put it onto the towel', E'Policy  A first moved the gripper close to the cup, grasped and released the edge of the cup, then closed and opened the gripper several times near the banana as if attempting to grasp it, but did not succeed in the end.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to pick up the banana from the cup then put it onto the towel, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A least grasped the cup, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'e02cc2f7-b049-4550-9aef-c4d97c150222', E'2025-11-12T03:10:51.206146Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the banana from the cup', E'Policy  A first moved the gripper close to the cup, approached the banana, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it and dropped it.Next, policy A moved the gripper away and stopped during remaining time of the episode.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to pick up the banana from the cup, when comparing the performance of the two, policy A completed the task successfully, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'66a18996-b04b-4aef-ab00-7f1c362cd265', E'2025-11-12T03:22:58.368466Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'cover the banana with the towel', E'Policy  A first moved the gripper toward the towel but moved away soon, then policy A moved the gripper randomly for a while, approached the towel, attempted to grasp it but did not succeed.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the towel but moved away soon.Then policy B approached the banana, pushed it.Next, policy B approached the towel, grasped it in the end.My instruction is to cover the banana with the towel,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least grasped the towel, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'fc771fd7-bce5-451c-baa4-b0119872a78d', E'2025-11-12T03:33:35.584422Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'close the book', E'Policy  A first moved the gripper close to the book, approached the edge of the book, adjusted posture, inserted the gripper under the cover, pushed the cover to make the book close.Then policy A moved the gripper away and stopped during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the book, adjusted posture, approached the edge of the book, pushed the pages of the book but did not succeed in closing the book.Then policy B moved the gripper slowly above the book until time ran out.My instruction is to close the book, when comparing the performance of the two, policy A completed the task successfully, whereas policy B failed.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'6891c34e-1b51-4447-97ce-bb7ad72218a3', E'2025-11-12T03:46:50.386924Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'open the book', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the book, adjusted posture,but moved away soon, then policy B moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to open the book, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least approached the book, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'c5715a4d-b4e4-434b-bd95-512f2940beda', E'2025-11-12T05:11:07.284899Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'write a letter o in the book with the marker pen', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward floor,then moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the marker pen, grasped it, picked it up, moved it and dropped it near the book.Then policy B attempted to grasped the marker pen again but failed, only pushed the marker pen to the book.My instruction is to write a letter o in the book with the marker pen, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked up the marker pen, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'de71659c-2b37-4f8f-9b95-a66f5354c7da', E'2025-11-12T05:19:59.711497Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'write a letter o in the book with the marker pen', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book, touched the book, then moved the gripper away.Next, policy A approached the marker pen and the book one after another during the remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the book, moved around the book for a while, touched the book, then moved the gripper away in the end.My instruction is to write a letter o in the book with the marker pen, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least approached marker pen, whereas policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is slightly better than policy B.'),
(E'b3b0046f-d189-4762-ae33-870540ad53ed', E'2025-11-12T08:12:33.980938Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the cup onto the book', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper back and forth for a while, then approached the cup but did not grasp it.Next, policy B moved slowly above the book during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to put the cup onto the book, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least approached the required object, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'cce3e25a-396a-4380-b3da-2a9d0cc7db51', E'2025-11-12T08:22:29.263216Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'turn the book upside down', E'Policy A first took some time to find the target, then approached the book, adjusted posture,then inserted the gripper under the book, grasped the edge of the book, as if attempting to turn the book over, but time ran out.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the book, adjusted posture, grasped and released the edge of the book, then moved the gripper away and moved randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to turn the book upside down, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies grasped the edge of the book, but policy A seemingly attempted to turn the book over while policy B did not.Therefore, i choose A.'),
(E'b49d9b89-e66f-4c89-8c41-521cbb380aec', E'2025-11-12T08:32:48.687512Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'rotate the marker pen by 90 degreesrotate the marker pen by 90 degrees', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the book, moved back and forth around the book for a while, touched the book, then moved the gripper away in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the marker pen, grasped it, picked it up, then rotated it by about 90 degrees and dropped it on floor.Next, policy B moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to rotate the marker pen by 90 degrees, when comparing the performance of the two, policy B completed the task successfully, whereas policy A did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
