(E'95708b13-886e-4264-82b9-6634a6ae9096', E'2025-11-19T09:31:55.976509Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stand the cup upright on sofa', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the cup, adjusted posture, but moved away soon.Then policy A approached the cup again, attempted to grasp it but did not succeed, only pushed it slightly.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the cup, adjusted posture, attempted to grasp the cup but did not succeed, only pushed the cup.Then policy B moved the gripper away and moved slowly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to stand the cup upright on sofa, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two,both polices failed to grasp the cup, only pushed the cup.Therefore, i choose tie.'),
