(E'cf4896cf-742c-4cd7-9149-d6dc7bab0759', E'2025-11-24T22:29:11.821176Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'Berkeley'), E'pick up the hand fan', E'Policy A grasped the watermelon instead of the handfan; their location are very close. Policy B attempted to reach the handle of the fan multiple times but it failed to g=find a better angle to grasp it in place'),
(E'36bc0b57-0abb-4c1a-af98-8b457e270be0', E'2025-11-24T22:44:23.953649Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the blue piece of toy into drawer', E'Policy B moved and tried to get the blue cup in hand while being asked to complete stuff with the blue pieces of toy. POlicy A had a right direction towards the toy but not sure if this was caused by chance since the toy was in the middle of everything'),
(E'a3eb23c7-a456-4168-ac99-8634eb5b64ee', E'2025-11-24T23:06:51.889859Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'remove the plushies from the red cupcake plate', E'Both policies have succeeded in removing the plushies and landed it off on the table. The instruction was very simple and clear so that might be why it did completely 100 for score'),
(E'0394a709-b65b-4d5a-b231-5c557c0f6d9d', E'2025-11-24T23:18:51.070776Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the watermelon into bowl', E'BOth policies failed to reach for the watermelon which was right on top far of the scene. B grasped the blue cubes and moved to onto the bowl (final destination) which is not sommething we want'),
(E'df1d1d0c-6bd0-4b75-86d8-988a6d0ae3bb', E'2025-11-24T23:37:45.562940Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'move the tape into pink bowl', E'Both policies completed the task very well. They rotated into the desired location within the very first minutes upon starting. The gripper in B also grasped the green bowl after all'),
(E'17facd16-e10b-419c-b2a7-96de68165d28', E'2025-11-24T23:57:23.051257Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'berkeley'), E'stack the pink bowl onto green bowl', E'POlicy A did stacking the green bowl onto the pink bowl but policy B did the other way around. Both are able to respond somehow relevant to the command'),
(E'b948f606-a8a1-444a-9d01-01f53e024a5c', E'2025-11-25T01:07:19.338055Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the banana', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the banana, pushed it slightly, then moved the gripper away and moved randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to pick up the banana, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least pushed the banana, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'54adfa71-2669-424c-bd39-1a2f02a18dde', E'2025-11-25T02:07:56.299303Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'wipe the drawer with the towel', E'Policy A first moved the gripper slightly, then stopped during remaining time of the episode.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to wipe the drawer with the towel,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least moved the gripper slightly, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is slightly better than policy B.'),
(E'a98e0e5c-f22e-4272-9062-65bf8bf77bfe', E'2025-11-25T02:18:56.066654Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'wipe the drawer with the towel', E'Policy A moved the gripper randomly during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.Policy B first moved the gripper randomly during most time episode, then approached the towel but moved away soon.My instruction is to wipe the drawer with the towel, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least approached the towel, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is slightly better than policy A.'),
(E'ffeb64c8-d825-4425-bd40-955e2cd527ed', E'2025-11-25T02:33:22.920496Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the towel', E'Policy A moved the gripper randomly during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.Policy B also moved the gripper back and forth during entire time of the trial, as if could not find the target.My instruction is to pick up the towel, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies only moved the gripper, but seemingly did not find the towel.Therefore, i choose tie.'),
(E'8cae7af5-485f-4452-8acd-0a15e80fc1dd', E'2025-11-25T02:44:36.715502Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the eraser into the plate', E'Policy A first moved the gripper randomly during most time of the episode, then approached the red wooden block in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the red wooden block,made multiple attempts to grasp it but did not succeed.My instruction is to put the eraser into the plate, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies only approached the red wooden block rather than the eraser, but policy B at least attempted to grasp the wrong object, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, i choose B.'),
(E'7b06882c-13f2-4874-9eca-07647c956982', E'2025-11-25T02:58:31.555758Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the red block into the plate', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the red block,then made multiple attempts to grasp it during most time of the episode, but did not succeed in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the red block,  adjusted posture, attempted to grasped it but did not succeed.Then policy B moved the gripper toward the plate and opened the gripper above the plate as if dropping something.My instruction is to put the red block into the plate, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies attempted to grasp the red block and failed, but policy B moved the gripper above the plate, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is slightly better than policy A.'),
(E'483d8825-7157-42a4-85df-f9606c194808', E'2025-11-25T03:28:23.565898Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the cube into the plate', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the cube, attempted to grasp it but did not succeed,only pushed the cube.Then policy A approached the red block, attempted to grasp it but did not succeed.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the cube, grasped it, picked it up, then move it toward the plate and dropped it on floor.Next,policy B attempted to grasp the cube again until time ran out.My instruction is to put the cube into the plate, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked up and moved the cube, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'60063948-a712-478e-a9e2-111c7988a1b8', E'2025-11-25T03:49:15.301866Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the plate onto the cube', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the edge of the sofa,attempted to grasped it, then approached the plate, adjusted posture, attempted to grasped but did not succeed.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the plate, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the cube, dropped it on floor.Next, policy B approached the plate again, attempted to grasp it until time ran out.My instruction is to put the plate onto the cube, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked up and moved the plate, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'bd3669f0-8980-41f1-8f00-2c8ecced90e2', E'2025-11-25T05:12:59.957901Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stack up the two cups', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to one cup, attempted to grasped it, but knocked the cup over.Then policy A grasped the cup, moved it, causing the cup fall off to floor.Next, policy A approached another cup, grasped it, picked it up and dropped it on sofa.Policy B first moved the gripper close to one cup, attempted to grasp it, but knocked the cup over.Then policy B made multiple attempts to grasp the cup, picked it up and dropped it.My instruction is to stack up the two cups, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A grasped two cups, whereas policy B grasped one cup.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'9bef2e89-323b-4846-89ef-4fdd33200376', E'2025-11-25T05:23:45.400435Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the red block into the left cup', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the red block,grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the cup and dropped it on floor.Next, policy A moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the red block, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it to the left cup, dropped it into the left cup.Next, policy B moved the gripper close to the cube, grasped it, picked it up, moved it and dropped it.My instruction is to put the red block into the left cup, when comparing the performance of the two, policy B completed the task successfully, whereas policy A failed.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'3eb78775-1ef7-4c00-9358-750679375798', E'2025-11-25T05:45:36.123380Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stand the cup upright on sofa', E'Policy A showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the cup, adjusted posture, made multiple attempted to grasp the cup, then picked it up and dropped it on sofa.My instruction is to stand the cup upright on sofa, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least picked the cup, whereas policy A did not do anything.Therefore, policy B is obviously better than policy A.'),
(E'7682c8cd-6c73-4386-9192-9079af67458f', E'2025-11-25T06:11:39.565276Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stand the cup upright on sofa', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the cup,adjusted posture, pushed the cup,attempted to grasp the cup several times during remaining time of the episode, but did not succeed in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper close to the cup, adjusted posture, attempted to grasp the cup but did not succeed.Then policy B moved the gripper slowly around the cup during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to stand the cup upright on sofa, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least pushed the cup, whereas policy B did not reach the cup.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'450374fa-30c0-4f53-a806-98491fd76b93', E'2025-11-25T06:34:44.981822Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'turn the plate upside down', E'Policy A first moved the gripper close to the plate, grasped it, picked it up, then rotated it during most time of the episode,as if attempting to turn the plate upside down but failed, dropped it on floor in the end.Policy B showed no response to my command and did not perform any operations at all.My instruction is to turn the plate upside down, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least picked up and rotated the plate, whereas policy B did not do anything.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
