(E'1795e6cd-66a3-469d-a88d-c066377d6d0c', E'2026-01-30T01:28:41.487884Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'nvidia'), E'remove the tape from the notebook', E'Policy A touched the notebook but did not attempt to grab the tape. Policy B touched the tape and attempted to grasp it. Policy B was closer to completing the task.'),
(E'792bcbda-c877-4296-bd8b-2192fd88deec', E'2026-01-30T01:37:24.691349Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'close the book', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the book, attempted to grasp it but did not succeed, then policy A hovered above the book during most remaining time of the episode,attempted to grasp the book again, touched the book.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the book, adjusted posture, approached the edge of the book but moved away soon, then policy B moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to close the book,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least reached the book, whereas policy B did not.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'3e9b59ef-81dd-439b-9505-5158f4915bfa', E'2026-01-30T01:38:07.471507Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'nvidia'), E'open the book', E'Policy A opened the book partially, while Policy B opened the book entirely. Policy B was more successful.'),
(E'6456ae9b-96b5-4f29-a2f8-14265e380e66', E'2026-01-30T01:55:21.362849Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'nvidia'), E'put the shoes into the box', E'Both policies placed one shoe into the box and approached the second shoe. Policy B was able to pick up the second shoe, while Policy A only touched it. Policy B was slightly faster, and therefore preferable over Policy A here.'),
(E'853c5fc9-4e4f-4efd-a871-81c5cb8ed3f1', E'2026-01-30T02:11:51.997036Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'nvidia'), E'put the crown on the spider', E'Both policies picked up the spider unnecessarily. Policy B did eventually reach for the crown after moving the spider, attempting to grasp it. Policy B scores higher for this reason'),
(E'9d07946c-61e3-4b4d-8f36-29be94a6f432', E'2026-01-30T02:23:32.617324Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'nvidia'), E'Put the red block in the matching mailbox', E'Policy A placed the block in the matching mailbox. Policy B picked up the block but was not quick enough to place it anywhere, although it reached toward the correct mailbox. Policy A was faster and completed the task successfully.'),
(E'4975f6c9-9bfe-45b3-abf1-50a7e535ce18', E'2026-01-30T17:46:17.999790Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'nvidia'), E'Put the apple on the red can', E'A went for the apple, just did not get it to the can. B willfully ignored the apple, going for the orange and shallot, although it did try to put the shallot ontop of the can.'),
(E'5baadc2b-b3cf-4694-80e9-98b3d6cb7073', E'2026-01-30T22:49:04.193441Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'nvidia'), E'Put the balloon in the wooden box', E'B picked up the correct object. A did not. B put it in the incorrect container.'),
