(E'68c1b0f5-1a1c-487b-a3cf-188b15f00e79', E'2026-03-03T03:21:01.089783Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'press the yellow button of the controller', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the remote control, closed the gripper, pressed the blank area of the controller, then pressed the gray button beside the yellow button.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the book, attempted to grasp it, pressed it, then moved gripper back and forth during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to press the yellow button of the controller,neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A almost completed the task, whereas policy B did not do anything relevant.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
(E'd71105a3-c90a-4c0b-85c5-cd50255a87ae', E'2026-03-03T03:43:41.340193Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'press the round button of the controller', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the controller, closed the gripper,pressed the blank area of the controller, then pressed the rectangle  button beside the round button.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the controller, closed the gripper, as if attempted to press the controller, then policy B moved the gripper back and forth during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to press the round button of the controller, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A almost completed the task, whereas policy B only approached the controller.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.')
