(E'16b6c0a6-497f-4366-a118-fd767f9d1fd4', E'2026-05-14T03:53:30.047447Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'pick up the middle block', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the middle block, grasped it, picked it up, dropped it, then policy A picked the left block and dropped it.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the right block, attempted to grasp it, then policy B moved the gripper randomly during remaining time of the episode.My instruction is to pick up the middle block, when comparing the performance of the tow, policy A completed the task successfully, whereas policy B failed.Therefore, policy A is obviously better than policy B.'),
