(E'fbcab2d8-8b4c-4db2-9bcc-64357fbb63e4', E'2026-06-06T14:24:08.318836Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'CIIRC, CTU in Prague'), E'place the cloth over the black wallet', E'Policy A picked up the cloth and brought it to the wallet but then did not drop it on top of the wallet. Policy B instead dragged the cloth to the wallet, but did not completely place it on top of the wallet. However, technically, a part of the cloth is placed on top of the wallet in the case of Policy B. Therefore policy B was selected.'),
