(E'd3b3018a-fa3f-4b3c-972d-a8dbd5a3c229', E'2026-07-09T04:00:37.134303Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'cover the can with the towel', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the towel, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it, dropped it.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the towel, grasped it, released it, then policy B attempted to grasp the towel several times, but did not succeed.My instruction is to cover the can with the towel, neither policy was able to compete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least picked up the towel, whereas policy B only grasped it.Therefore,  i choose policy A.'),
(E'bce480e6-f517-40c4-9375-c481fde37c93', E'2026-07-09T06:58:24.395038Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the socks together', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the bubble bag, touched it, then policy A moved the gripper back and forth during remaining time of the episode.Policy B moved the gripper randomly during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.My instruction is to put the socks together, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, both policies can''t find the socks.Therefore, i choose tie.'),
(E'0088631c-7020-435c-8feb-4d0955d88077', E'2026-07-09T07:09:45.486783Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the socks together', E'Policy A moved the gripper back and forth during entire time of the episode, as if could not find the target.Policy B first moved the gripper randomly for a while, then approached the right sock, attempted to grasp it, but did not succeed.My instruction is to put the socks together, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least attempted to grasp the sock, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'92183ba6-105e-42be-8db8-ef44273740cb', E'2026-07-15T10:08:28.926769Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'stack up the two cups', E'Policy A first moved the gripper back and forth for a while, then picked up the right cup in the end.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the left cup, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the right cup, put it into the right cup.My instruction is to stack up the two cups, when comparing the performance of the two, policy B completed the task successfully, whereas policy A failed.Therefore, i choose policy B.'),
(E'030bb49d-2b7c-4ab4-9e5a-3bc056edbf78', E'2026-07-15T10:17:49.405554Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'put the wooden block into the cup', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the wooden block, grasped it, picked it up, then moved it toward the cup, dropped it near the cup.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the wooden block, then stopped above the wooden block.My instruction is to put the wooden block into the cup, neither policy was able to complete the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy A at least dropped the wooden block near the cup, whereas policy B did not even touch the wooden block.Therefore, policy A is better than policy B.'),
(E'08dd67a2-7281-4d70-9ced-c0dd97c284dd', E'2026-07-16T08:43:43.005700Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'frodobots'), E'rotate the controller by 90 degrees', E'Policy A first moved the gripper toward the controller, touched it,then grasped it, picked it up and dropped it.Policy B first moved the gripper toward the controller,but moved away soon, then picked it up, rotated it by 180 degrees, dropped  it on the table.My instruction is to rotate the controller by 90 degrees, neither policy was able to completed the task.When comparing the performance of the two, policy B at least rotated the controller, whereas policy A did not.Therefore, policy B is better than policy A.'),
(E'e1217ac6-cd46-4403-9e7c-1877b3c84baa', E'2026-07-16T12:42:24.270267Z', (SELECT id FROM sites WHERE name = E'CIIRC, CTU in Prague'), E'Put the strawberry into the bowl', E'Policy A correctly identified the strawberry in the scene, but then confidently put it into a stationary cup instead of a bowl that was right next to it. Policy B picked up the strawberry and immediately placed it into the bowl, successfully copleting the task, therefore it is preferred. Policy B bumped into the bowl a bit, but otherwise did good.')
